blockId":"block.1","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.1","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblthrenin"}]},{"blockId":"block.a8d849ac25e943b9a3a778867ed7d492","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.11","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblthrenin i venel"}]},{"blockId":"block.664ae5c518894ccbb5e43a32153e1d28","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.30","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblthrenin: 1 nel i y\u00ebl."}]},{"blockId":"block.8c26e48f30f84f96923ea1e9fc78f15b","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.55","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Zarilun \u00e3\u00d1 murfraadun ni z\u00e1rthirilun i gimolnaor\u2019m\u00e7 f\u00d7venorun ragumowya k\u00e3m z\u00ebrelun \u00cbers y\u00eblverzetnil\u00ebm tw\u00ddnjyb\u2019es j\u00cden\u2019m\u00e7 y\u00eblj\u00d7n mayata\u00d9owya \u00e3\u00d1 po\u2019y\u00eblthrenin tha marjo\u00d9 i ragum\u2019es tarenowya vorelton."}]},{"blockId":"block.1d4e0315b8e8496e907f4565b1760eef","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.256","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"2 y\u00ebl threnin."}]},{"blockId":"block.81b637942544451ea8dcc79da29da1a1","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.271","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Venik thenthren y\u00eblyemar\u00e7ztjemun r\u00c7n\u00d3 ly \u00db\u00c7dizya, p\u00c7n\u00df\u00eb neks y\u00eblthrenin r\u00c7n\u00d3 darum\u00c7pibaimizfu y\u00eblyemar\u00e7ztjem kin ni y\u00eblyemargl\u00c9z\u00cben vutizya ly."}]},{"blockId":"block.b1e47a3b3cb44e789f2339b8a5027ee8","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.415","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"3 y\u00ebl shalin."}]},{"blockId":"block.fe0d85ca236a4e7d974626969ef9754f","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.429","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Rav neksus i ne vimingim\u00cba\u00d5im\u2019m\u00e7 y\u00eblthrenin gl\u00c9stl\u00e1matya, \u00e3\u00d1 k\u00e3m y\u00d1t\u2019m\u00e7 y\u00ebl kr\u00ebna\u00d9atya, kr\u00ebna\u00d9atya."}]},{"blockId":"block.e4a2f28a4eb64727b229469cb60eed7b","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.529","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"4 y\u00ebl threnin."}]},{"blockId":"block.1cc316e6ed41491dbc2d1ab3c62ec6f1","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.544","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"\u00d0e\u00d5 ika\u00d9\u2019m\u00e7 kl\u00e1r\u00e7l\u00d7on etni ne \u00e3\u00d1 za\u2019zeren r\u00c7n\u00d3 y\u00eblthreninun kl\u00e1rjem\u2019en w\u00cfine zaget. R\u00e1\u2019vengrafun zeth grafel vengraff\u00c5w minlam den\u2019en, \u00d1e\u00d5 strasj\u00cd ni ne\u2019a\u00d9z y\u00cd\u00d7jw\u00ebnenplesten\u2019m\u00e7 k\u00e3v p\u00e1n ragumatya."}]},{"blockId":"block.ba93428de6ee42478595721bdd5b6490","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.740","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"5 melar."}]},{"blockId":"block.eb0a861ff953400c8ad32abb08b8106e","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.749","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Vinel i Yisr\u00c5l\u2019pelun ni var\u00ebljo\u00d9 r\u00d7izya s\u00dflumget falib y\u00eblthreninunget gren prodnadlen Yel z\u00dfgu\u00d9izya zem t\u00d7y\u00dfb\u00dfizya."}]},{"blockId":"block.281295cd6b814925adcbfddad19d35ea","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.866","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"6 y\u00ebl threnin."}]},{"blockId":"block.1cd968a88bbb48f2b78b5a44f071282b","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.881","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Kom melvorilshalem\u00c9lmim\u2019en zem\u2019len \u00e3\u00d1 \u00e7l\u00d7onget \u00d1ed valenowya\u2019m\u00e7 y\u00eblthreninun r\u00c7n\u00d3 le\u00db\u00c7f\u00c5w\u2019ve r\u00e1\u2019melinun; na \u00d1ed y\u00eblthreninun nel\u2019jelun venla\u2019m\u00e7 gathen\u2019rin m\u00e5rowya, n\u00d7nna\u2019m\u00e7 y\u00eblget \u00d5\u00dfrowya\u2019m\u00e7 melinun k\u00e3v y\u00cd\u00d7 prodf\u00c5wim\u2019m\u00e7 a\u00d9\u2019es."}]},{"blockId":"block.0edb504a051a4941b3c979900301af69","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1108","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblthrenin viminmeran: y\u00eblthrenin viminmeran."}]},{"blockId":"block.439562f4af0f47428b12ca3feb16e1f8","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1154","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Rav r\u00dfv Gwayakil w\u00ddyaz k\u00e3m thavim \u00c3\u00cdowfu, y\u00eblthrenin viminmeran lomih y\u00eblthrenin viminmeranun i \u00d5\u00c5tus gur k\u00e3m \u00d3\u00c5\u00e7owya ly gimol threnin t\u00d7 thenthren darum\u00c7pibaizfu \u00e7ztowfu."}]},{"blockId":"block.52a52eed184a47808e802c905e483d88","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1326","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblthrenin ni y\u00e9\u00dbna: Vimin\u2019m\u00e7 den i d\u00c7\u00d3 \u00d1etib ner\u00e7ztowya y\u00e9\u00dbna r\u00c7n\u00d3 s\u00dflum falib d\u00c7\u00d3 grasnotizya. Vesnaun p\u00e1f\u00d7\u2019m\u00e7 \u00d1et fartondaowya vinel a\u00d9s\u00dflum velin po semowya."}]},{"blockId":"block.ae34db8c946c421e804c9046156992bb","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1488","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Ol gren p\u00e1f\u00d7\u2019m\u00e7 y\u00ebl shalinsilen ve\u00d5izya. Y\u00eblthrenin ni y\u00e9\u00dbna r\u00e1\u2019i r\u00d7izya. R\u00e1\u2019pelena neks s\u00ebjemizya \u00e3\u00d1 pelam \u00e5\u00c3 r\u00e1\u2019vesna tremb\u00c5r f\u00c5wizya."}]},{"blockId":"block.d24efbf28c1c4cb9a4f63e55b375c259","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1625","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblthrenin i venel: Jw\u00ebnh\u00c5b\u00cdplesten\u2019m\u00e7 s\u00dflum d\u00c7\u00d3 venel\u2019m\u00e7 \u00d3\u00c5\u00e7owya \u00e3\u00d1 ni "}]}]}]},"styleFeatures":{"style.body":{"kern":true,"liga":true}},"characters":[{"start":0,"end":10,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":11,"end":29,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":30,"end":54,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":55,"end":255,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":256,"end":270,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":271,"end":414,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":415,"end":428,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":429,"end":528,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":529,"end":543,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpaci