4170","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.584","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblvrzetp\u00e1in: Y\u00eblverzet \u00d1etib kin marin ef\u2019verzet tav ragumowya."}]},{"blockId":"block.c14393adae4846cd8f6af7070b74e86e","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.649","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Lym kin p\u00e1in ma\u2019\u00c7pibaizya. Vin y\u00eblvrzetp\u00e1in t\u00e7lizya vorny\u00cd\u00d7 vorn\u2019m\u00e7 ragum\u00e7l\u00d7ono\u00c3t\u00e7 tar\u00d5izya."}]},{"blockId":"block.c867170ce41b41adb14dd58cc001287c","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.742","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblvrzetvejem: Den gren y\u00eblvenory\u00eblverzet \u00d1etib tremb\u00c5r thrin venor\u2019m\u00e7 \u00e5v a\u00d9owya."}]},{"blockId":"block.26a2b94da720434bbc35bc38d23f20d7","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.824","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"\u00d2\u00c5tus y\u00eblvenory\u00eblverzet ilna\u2019m\u00e7 \u00d3\u00e1lun\u00c3izya. Ni y\u00eblvrzetvejem r\u00e1\u2019mela h\u00c5b\u00cdizya \u00d1etib za\u2019k\u00cfba\u00d1 r\u00d7izya."}]},{"blockId":"block.ff24ab6b086f4ac5955680c3c6414c1f","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.925","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblvrzetvevor: Threnin i y\u00eblverzet \u00d1etib t\u00d7 thavvimna f\u00ebr jem\u00e3imowya."}]},{"blockId":"block.bbf04ceda5944caebdbe1b39a0fe81b2","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.995","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Zem gimam y\u00eblverzet \u00e7ztizya. R\u00e1 y\u00eblvrzetvevor t\u00d7 thavvimna venal jem\u00e3izya."}]},{"blockId":"block.b89780e3dd9e4bc7bda7f6465a339953","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1070","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblvrzetvesna: \u00d0et \u00d1etib ni \u00e7l\u00d7on i y\u00eblvenory\u00eblverzet po\u2019d\u00c7\u00d3 f\u00d7owya."}]},{"blockId":"block.f24da8b16c5c49fab08a84f53a9c4339","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1139","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Y\u00eblvenory\u00eblverzet b\u00e9rvimizya. Vinto po t\u00d7y\u00dfb\u00dfimizya y\u00eblvrzetvesna ly\u2019d\u00c7\u00d3 \u00db\u00c7dizya."}]},{"blockId":"block.8929ec8d34c14c11a3ce08cd69ba2fd7","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1221","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblvrzetfader: Y\u00eblvenory\u00eblverzet \u00d1etib h\u00ebth a\u00d9s\u00dflum \u00c3\u00cdthavowya \u00cbers tremb\u00c5run i k\u00cfba\u00d1s\u00dflumun venim d\u00c7\u00d3owya."}]},{"blockId":"block.4a730e9af25a417e82161f0a40557ad4","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1329","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"A\u00d9s\u00dflum venor\u2019m\u00e7 venor thav r\u00d7izya. Lym venik\u2019t threnin \u00e3lumizya \u00e3\u00d1 y\u00eblvrzetfader tav \u00e5vizya."}]},{"blockId":"block.41ee70b53f354f8393e6cac1dbf82403","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1423","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblvrzetf\u00ebr: \u00e2lum i y\u00eblverzet \u00d1etib venor i d\u00c7\u00d3 gl\u00c9stowya."}]},{"blockId":"block.e18bfca33285414a