","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.905","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Lym kin p\u00e1in ma\u2019\u00c7pibaizya. Vin y\u00eblvtvorp\u00e1in t\u00e7lizya vorny\u00cd\u00d7 vorn\u2019m\u00e7 ragum\u00e7l\u00d7ono\u00c3t\u00e7 tar\u00d5izya."}]},{"blockId":"block.e4e0cb048d2c4169b5d719cdc5f71c44","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.998","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblvtvorvevor: Threnin i y\u00eblverzetvor \u00d1etib t\u00d7 thavvimna f\u00ebr jem\u00e3imowya."}]},{"blockId":"block.7a568e6b7bc44e9bae2b6d8310da07b5","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1071","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Zem gimam y\u00eblverzetvor \u00e7ztizya. R\u00e1 y\u00eblvtvorvevor t\u00d7 thavvimna venal jem\u00e3izya."}]},{"blockId":"block.5fd579c8db49461b82a9fd1aa92b2d98","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1149","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblvtvorf\u00ebr: \u00e2lum i y\u00eblverzetvor \u00d1etib venor i d\u00c7\u00d3 gl\u00c9stowya."}]},{"blockId":"block.a50d2e4eff474c26827c4fcdb0f35e19","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1211","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Gren tav\u00ebr y\u00eblverzetvor \u00e3lumizya. \u00caers y\u00eblvtvorf\u00ebr zem venor i d\u00c7\u00d3 h\u00c5b\u00cdizya."}]},{"blockId":"block.8f1d1eaec94140e6adb32b649fbc501b","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1288","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblveranvejem: Den gren y\u00eblvorkinviminmeran \u00d1etib tre