text":"y\u00eblverzetnel\u00ebrkw\u00d7sil: y\u00eblverzet nel\u00ebr kw\u00d7sil."}]},{"blockId":"block.01638d1dbd794511be2ba2421b2ab03c","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.80","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Neksus\u2019t r\u00d7owya \u00d1e\u00d5: T\u00d7 kelde\u00dbon, mem i ka her\u00dbner\u00c3\u00cd j\u00c9gwa\u00c3vorenet, y\u00eblverzetnel\u00ebrkw\u00d7sil."}]},{"blockId":"block.9a540317950148638bbc58ee427f5618","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.170","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblverzetnil\u00ebm: y\u00eblverzet nil\u00ebm."}]},{"blockId":"block.3dc8df40269745aaaf68aea1b9e1df65","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.203","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Y\u00eblverzetun i Denarvenek plesten i y\u00eblverzetnil\u00ebm r\u00d7owya y\u00ebl\u00c5run i Lebanon \u00d1etib zi verzetowfu."}]},{"blockId":"block.958b1640855c4ff0a68a128fbbf0f8f9","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.299","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblverzetnimfel: y\u00eblverzet nimfel."}]},{"blockId":"block.a84af6741f1747d1a1172ab5268ac0a9","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.334","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Ni ragum\u00e7l\u00d7ono\u00c3t\u00e7 y\u00eblverzetnimfel ragumizya."}]},{"blockId":"block.645e27aff0bf446ebfab3304404434c1","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.379","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblverzetshalem: y\u00eblverzet shalem."}]},{"blockId":"block.7496b4deb24c4f6990aa603da9229a54","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.414","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Neget w\u00cfinowya r\u00e1, ni zem\u2019y\u00eblverzetshalem a\u00d9z\u2019lilunget \u00ddv\u2019es y\u00cd\u00d7 y\u00eblverzetunget ma\u2019murf\u00d7e."}]},{"blockId":"block.f7ae1cba7a294c86b24650755cdec97c","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.505","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblverzetshalem thiril y\u00eblverzet: y\u00eblverzetshalem thiril y\u00eblverzet."}]},{"blockId":"block.c17282c1a9474510bb89958b99776a47","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.573","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Drig\u00e1l \u00e7zt\u2019en \u00e3\u00d1 ynstum\u2019en \u00d3\u00c5tusol t\u00d7 zem\u2019thiril jw\u00ebnenplestenun y\u00eblverzetshalem thiril y\u00eblverzet i y\u00eblverzetshalem tha a\u00d9owya zem. M\u00ebren Indiz olthrin gim\u00dfv ragumowya \u00d1etib y\u00eblverzet lomih viminy\u00eblverzet p\u00e1l\u00dfn r\u00d7owya po; po\u2019y\u00eblverzetshalem gim jw\u00ebnenplesten thirilun i a\u00d9imowya."}]},{"blockId":"block.5b49293411174a96a5245f8196afe89f","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.853","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblverzetstemil: y\u00eblverzet verzethalemin\u00d7."}]},{"blockId":"block.57cd45ad77324b49956a4a3cc87a39fa","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.896","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"P\u00c7n\u00df\u00eb venim ni po threnine\u00dbn\u00c9 r\u00d7atya \u00e3\u00d1 po sezif\u00c7\u00c3atya \u00e3\u00d1 wemimatya k\u00e3m teil \u00e3\u00d1 k\u00e3m dornel falibi y\u00eblverzetstemil ni zem r\u00d7owya vin zem zem\u2019y\u00ebletunget tarnowya kom prodna p\u00e1in po\u2019y\u00eblverzetstemil r\u00d7atya."}]},{"blockId":"block.e96c81890a3b4627a91860e82e1502a7","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1099","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblverzetyemsinin: y\u00eblverzet yemsinin."}]},{"blockId":"block.0c76c7203d264a53ab7459482b7728c2","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1138","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"P\u00e1n int\u00dff\u00c9bentonizya r\u00e1 ka yems\u00d7 yaten yemkwesun \u00e3\u00d1 al kw\u00d7silun i m\u00ebrvenkwesta, y\u00eblverzetyemsinin, taremmelun \u00e3\u00d1 vesna j\u00c9gwa\u00c3l\u00dfn vorenl\u00dfnun rennastrasatya."}]},{"blockId":"block.25bbcf327a6241148aa4e242a0a26ac4","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1294","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblvelunp\u00e1in: Y\u00eblverzetmelun \u00d1etib kin marin ef\u2019verzet tav ragumowya."}]},{"blockId":"block.29307909759f4a41a072fc4b4c1e23ea","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1364","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Lym kin p\u00e1in ma\u2019\u00c7pibaizya. Vin y\u00eblvelunp\u00e1in t\u00e7lizya vorny\u00cd\u00d7 vorn\u2019m\u00e7 ragum\u00e7l\u00d7ono\u00c3t\u00e7 tar\u00d5izya."}]},{"blockId":"block.d5cbd57adba648f6ae200cd8ef0f7bf5","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1457","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblvelunvevor: Threnin i y\u00eblverzetmelun \u00d1etib t\u00d7 thavvimna f\u00ebr jem\u00e3imowya."}]},{"blockId":"block.8d839a60258f49859861cb63db74f0a8","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1532","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Zem gimam y\u00eblverzetmelun \u00e7ztizya. R\u00e1 y\u00eblvelunvevor t\u00d7 thavvimna venal jem\u00e3izya."}]},{"blockId":"block.63b62a2b226b4927a81db9da9116852b","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1612","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblvelunf\u00ebr: \u00e2lum i y\u00eblverzetmelun \u00d1etib venor i d\u00c7\u00d3 gl\u00c9stowya."}]},{"blockId":"block.d2f147c188494d7ab3006a91d87731e2","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1676","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Gren tav\u00ebr y\u00eblverzetmelun \u00e3lumizya. \u00caers y\u00eblvelunf\u00ebr zem venor i d\u00c7\u00d3 h\u00c5b\u00cdizya."}]},{"blockId":"block.271e0a49542b488f9b6b897442804294","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1755","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblvemilp\u00e1in: Y\u00eblverzetstemil \u00d1etib kin marin ef\u2019verzet tav ragumowya."}]}]}]},"styleFeatures":{"style.body":{"kern":true,"liga":true}},"characters":[{"start":0,"end":20,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":21,"end":33,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":34,"end":79,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":80,"end":169,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":170,"end":202,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":203,"end":298,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":299,"end":333,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":334,"end":378,"att