"type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Y\u00eblentarven b\u00e9rvimizya. Vinto po t\u00d7y\u00dfb\u00dfimizya y\u00eblervenvesna ly\u2019d\u00c7\u00d3 \u00db\u00c7dizya."}]},{"blockId":"block.1fe0bce69940419ab720c5d7d1a4f286","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.330","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblervenfader: Y\u00eblentarven \u00d1etib h\u00ebth a\u00d9s\u00dflum \u00c3\u00cdthavowya \u00cbers tremb\u00c5run i k\u00cfba\u00d1s\u00dflumun venim d\u00c7\u00d3owya."}]},{"blockId":"block.2f2b26a92e464d188064fe3614211c46","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.432","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"A\u00d9s\u00dflum venor\u2019m\u00e7 venor thav r\u00d7izya. Lym venik\u2019t threnin \u00e3lumizya \u00e3\u00d1 y\u00eblervenfader tav \u00e5vizya."}]},{"blockId":"block.23eefcd368184540be3482971c4b395c","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.526","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblerzetp\u00e1in: Y\u00eblethareny\u00eblverzet \u00d1etib kin marin ef\u2019verzet tav ragumowya."}]},{"blockId":"block.a5ace9757f6f40f1ae7fff2fb4e26f76","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.601","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Lym kin p\u00e1in ma\u2019\u00c7pibaizya. Vin y\u00eblerzetp\u00e1in t\u00e7lizya vorny\u00cd\u00d7 vorn\u2019m\u00e7 ragum\u00e7l\u00d7ono\u00c3t\u00e7 tar\u00d5izya."}]},{"blockId":"block.923749b98056486cbc2618710856ee16","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.694","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblerzetvevor: Threnin i y\u00eblethareny\u00eblverzet \u00d1etib t\u00d7 thavvimna f\u00ebr jem\u00e3imowya."}]},{"blockId":"block.f4b253d6e0804882b844349a9f7f01e6","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.774","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Zem gimam y\u00eblethareny\u00eblverzet \u00e7ztizya. R\u00e1 y\u00eblerzetvevor t\u00d7 thavvimna venal jem\u00e3izya."}]},{"blockId":"block.4c105729dc5e4711b62069441807a197","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.859","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblerzetf\u00ebr: \u00e2lum i y\u00eblethareny\u00eblverzet \u00d1etib venor i d\u00c7\u00d3 gl\u00c9stowya."}]},{"blockId":"block.d045ff22136f40698b3f28df9c3e63d4","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.928","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Gren tav\u00ebr y\u00eblethareny\u00eblverzet \u00e3lumizya. \u00caers y\u00eblerzetf\u00ebr zem venor i d\u00c7\u00d3 h\u00c5b\u00cdizya."}]},{"blockId":"block.abe1f5dc9b164d2584475dbacfaceff6","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1012","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblermiljeem\u00e3: \u00e6l\u00d7on k\u00c7nib y\u00ebletvermil vingim sezif\u00c7\u00c3owya t\u00d7 jemekjem\u00e3."}]},{"blockId":"block.9b1ea42229054f6f8b888fe9c754d123","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1084","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Yelp\u00e1n y\u00ebletvermil kin o\u00c3braizya. Venyel tav. Lym tha y\u00eblermiljeem\u00e3 \u00c3\u00cdthavizya."}]},{"blockId":"block.9aa6163e98294b3ebc89be8df6e8aa68","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1164","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblermilden: Den i y\u00ebletvermil \u00cbers \u00d1etib thavvim\u2019m\u00e7 y\u00ebletvermil h\u00c5b\u00cdimowya."}]},{"blockId":"block.13bfd35e65fa4ddebb55c4f8e277efee","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1241","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Zem y\u00ebletvermil ma\u2019o\u00c3izya. Pel den t\u00d7y\u00dfb\u00dfizya \u00e3\u00d1 y\u00eblermilden gl\u00c9stizya."}]},{"blockId":"block.a8fd0198ce154584b8a0bc40be4b457b","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1313","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblermilsef\u00c7\u00c3: Y\u00ebletvermil \u00d1etib vingim \u00e5\u00c3 ilna\u2019m\u00e7 \u00e7l\u00d7on sezif\u00c7\u00c3owya kom kinos wa\u00d9gum\u2019jw\u00ebnimowya."}]},{"blockId":"block.53d870245e624078ae5b27b3187975d9","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1411","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Yelp\u00e1n \u00e3\u00d1 venyel po ni ilna\u2019m\u00e7 kwesta \u00d3\u00e1lun\u00c3izya. Pel d\u00cdn\u00d7r ma\u2019f\u00c5wizya. Venim za za\u2019y\u00eblermilsef\u00c7\u00c3 h\u00c5b\u00cdizya."}]},{"blockId":"block.1d56dfe869d14edab2fb4b6caf001569","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1519","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblet: y\u00eblverzet lomih yelin\u2019i thirilin\u2019m\u00e7 y\u00d1t\u2019m\u00e7 threnin."}]},{"blockId":"block.058fee6fdafd4b2e8adfed1c4c0fcbbd","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1578","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Zi\u2019\u00e3 l\u00ddn\u00c5r y\u00eblverzet \u00d1etib \u00cbers nilomun i yems\u00d7 verzetimowya r\u00d7atya \u00d1etib po\u2019venamget ni po\u2019f\u00ebr thar y\u00c9nenowya zi\u2019y\u00eblet al ma\u2019mayemslevatya \u00e3\u00d1 \u00d1etibgrafel zi f\u00d7owya farvengrafatya."}]}]}]},"styleFeatures":{"style.body":{"kern":true,"liga":true}},"characters":[{"start":0,"end":13,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":14,"end":19,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":20,"end":95,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":96,"end":190,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":191,"end":253,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":254,"end":329,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":330,"end":431,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":432,"end":525,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":526,"end":600,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":601,"end":693,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":694,"end":773,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":774,"end":858,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":859,"end":927,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":928,"end":1011,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":1012,"end":1083,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":1084,"end":1163,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":1164,"end":1240,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":1241,"end":1312,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":1313,"end":1410,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":1411,"end":1518,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":1519,"end":1577,"attributes