lock.9cc787d07cc04da0ac7604b5ff1439d9","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.212","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Vesna tremb\u00c5r ilna\u2019m\u00e7 falnthren \u00cbers vengraf f\u00d7izya. R\u00e1\u2019y\u00ebleil\u00ebmveerb r\u00e1 p\u00e1n s\u00ebvenun nerbyalizya."}]},{"blockId":"block.c6b5ffd81e884bd0b785b0fff503eb34","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.310","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00ebleil\u00ebmin\u00dfb\u00df: Y\u00eblendest\u00eb\u00c5nil\u00ebm k\u00e3m vesna s\u00dflum nerbyalizya f\u00d7\u2019en p\u00c7n\u00df\u00eb t\u00d7 k\u00cfba\u00d1\u2019m\u00e7 f\u00c7l broft\u2019en."}]},{"blockId":"block.983b2f5c6dfa41d1a980f09e47ea3252","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.408","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Nerbyal za\u2019k\u00cfba\u00d1 r\u00d7izya. R\u00c7n\u00d3 r\u00e1\u2019tremb\u00c5r r\u00e1 y\u00ebleil\u00ebmin\u00dfb\u00dfizya \u00e3\u00d1 t\u00d7 murlametw\u00c5vum r\u00e1 broftizya."}]},{"blockId":"block.15717e2f398d4864a468e345a34ae3a9","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.504","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00ebleina\u00d9hy\u00c5v\u00cd: Y\u00eblenthrenina\u00d9 \u00d1etib h\u00ebth po\u2019h\u00eb \u00c3\u00cdthavowya venim dlen\u00dbeminowya."}]},{"blockId":"block.466349fdedc145b1a4b77e04c1f8ca19","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.583","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Zem h\u00eb \u00e7ztthavizya \u00e3\u00d1 neksus yel wa\u00d9gumizya. Y\u00ebleina\u00d9hy\u00c5v\u00cd dlen\u00dbeminizya."}]},{"blockId":"block.2c0abd192b384d94ba184cfe5fb6d66a","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.657","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00ebleina\u00d9dlmin: Y\u00eblenthrenina\u00d9 kom thavim \u00e3lum\u2019en ka vin h\u00eb \u00c3\u00cdthavowya p\u00e1nna\u2019m\u00e7 len ma\u2019sezif\u00c7\u00c3owya."}]},{"blockId":"block.723617a85d9a45b6b72b6aa148bf7ae6","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.756","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Lym h\u00eb \u00e7ztthavizya. Vin thavvimna venser ilna\u2019m\u00e7 \u00e3lum dlen\u00dbeminizya lym po y\u00ebleina\u00d9dlminowfu tondaizya."}]},{"blockId":"block.413e683c1b414b988d4a987fe4580caa","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.860","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00ebleina\u00d9shal: Y\u00eblenthrenina\u00d9 \u00d1etib vin po\u2019h\u00eb \u00c3\u00cdthavowya tav elyi\u00d1owya."}]},{"blockId":"block.b4108ceaa66c48109b91b30ca5d226ae","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.931","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Vin tremb\u00c5r \u00e7ztthavimizya vorn\u2019m\u00e7 l\u00dfn sezif\u00c7\u00c3izya. \u00d0e\u00d5 y\u00ebleina\u00d9shal r\u00d7izya."}]},{"blockId":"block.4dabf7e97447484db3ef815d0ea30b40","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1007","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00ebleukinvejem: Den gren y\u00eblendest\u00eb\u00c5hukin \u00d1etib tremb\u00c5r thrin venor\u2019m\u00e7 \u00e5v a\u00d9owya."}]},{"blockId":"block.f80060ac68c9497f9f1390ca7b235ca3","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1088","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"\u00d2\u00c5tus y\u00eblendest\u00eb\u00c5hukin ilna\u2019m\u00e7 \u00d3\u00e1lun\u00c3izya. Ni y\u00ebleukinvejem r\u00e1\u2019mela h\u00c5b\u00cdizya \u00d1etib za\u2019k\u00cfba\u00d1 r\u00d7izya."}]},{"blockId":"block.4378bb903c4b408aae2d3b43c772340e","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1188","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00ebleukinvesna: \u00d0et \u00d1etib ni \u00e7l\u00d7on i y\u00eblendest\u00eb\u00c5hukin po\u2019d\u00c7\u00d3 f\u00d7owya."}]},{"blockId":"block.0ab6a1eb89864a1eaa8a1a30381560a4","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1256","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Y\u00eblendest\u00eb\u00c5hukin b\u00e9rvimizya. Vinto po t\u00d7y\u00dfb\u00dfimizya y\u00ebleukinvesna ly\u2019d\u00c7\u00d3 \u00db\u00c7dizya."}]},{"blockId":"block.59f28c80adf5423a9ff5cbe429603325","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1337","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00ebleukinfader: Y\u00eblendest\u00eb\u00c5hukin \u00d1etib h\u00ebth a\u00d9s\u00dflum \u00c3\u00cdthavowya \u00cbers tremb\u00c5run i k\u00cfba\u00d1s\u00dflumun venim d\u00c7\u00d3owya."}]},{"blockId":"block.fd4665e1094642a88f9b938bf08b37d7","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1444","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"A\u00d9s\u00dflum venor\u2019m\u00e7 venor thav r\u00d7izya. Lym venik\u2019t threnin \u00e3lumizya \u00e3\u00d1 y\u00ebleukinfader tav \u00e5vizya."}]},{"blockId":"block.de8fadef1af949dd80fa9a67cea43d82","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1538","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"