on lym y\u00eble\u00eblentae\u00db\u00e7 r\u00c7n\u00d3 nesh\u2019m\u00e7 voren jem\u00e3izya."}]},{"blockId":"block.e19402528c4d411bbbfa3ae23982bbf1","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.290","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eble\u00eblenika\u00d9: Vimin\u2019m\u00e7 threnin i y\u00ebletsh\u00eblen \u00d1etib p\u00e1n \u00e3lum jem\u00e3imowya t\u00d7 l\u00e1mgl\u00c9st."}]},{"blockId":"block.cf5453127bba408a82e452ac40b6379e","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.374","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"H\u00ebth zarun ol vesna\u2019m\u00e7 \u00d3\u00e1lun\u00c3izya. Lym po r\u00c7n\u00d3 y\u00eble\u00eblenika\u00d9 k\u00e3menizya."}]},{"blockId":"block.42e79794d8484a3c97fb1ee328fbc5a5","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.445","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eble\u00ebmenp\u00e1in: Y\u00ebletr\u00ebmen \u00d1etib kin marin ef\u2019verzet tav ragumowya."}]},{"blockId":"block.39e55beb41e34a4c8acca77ddef08c7e","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.511","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Lym kin p\u00e1in ma\u2019\u00c7pibaizya. Vin y\u00eble\u00ebmenp\u00e1in t\u00e7lizya vorny\u00cd\u00d7 vorn\u2019m\u00e7 ragum\u00e7l\u00d7ono\u00c3t\u00e7 tar\u00d5izya."}]},{"blockId":"block.22e3b74ce3fd41509cb9971c394db3f5","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.604","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eble\u00ebmenvevor: Threnin i y\u00ebletr\u00ebmen \u00d1etib t\u00d7 thavvimna f\u00ebr jem\u00e3imowya."}]},{"blockId":"block.1976c435bf8d46acbea8ae1f15e2d346","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.675","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Zem gimam y\u00ebletr\u00ebmen \u00e7ztizya. R\u00e1 y\u00eble\u00ebmenvevor t\u00d7 thavvimna venal jem\u00e3izya."}]},{"blockId":"block.16ad6b0958564ebfbea07a7c700dd8b6","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.751","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eble\u00ebmenf\u00ebr: \u00e2lum i y\u00ebletr\u00ebmen \u00d1etib venor i d\u00c7\u00d3 gl\u00c9stowya."}]},{"blockId":"block.1ff5d94a474343eaae20bdd55df1781d","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.811","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Gren tav\u00ebr y\u00ebletr\u00ebmen \u00e3lumizya. \u00caers y\u00eble\u00ebmenf\u00ebr zem venor i d\u00c7\u00d3 h\u00c5b\u00cdizya."}]},{"blockId":"block.138684b72b9546b0964c710a234052df","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.886","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00ebl\u00d7rvenp\u00e1in: Y\u00ebl\u00d7\u00d3tarven \u00d1etib kin marin ef\u2019verzet tav ragumowya."}]},{"blockId":"block.a985cb4c9fcc436ca2c93f9ba7272658","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.953","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Lym kin p\u00e1in ma\u2019\u00c7pibaizya. Vin y\u00ebl\u00d7rvenp\u00e1in t\u00e7lizya vorny\u00cd\u00d7 vorn\u2019m\u00e7 ragum\u00e7l\u00d7ono\u00c3t\u00e7 tar\u00d5izya."}]},{"blockId":"block.7ee9740ffc464dc8ad4c0d537a4c2cf7","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1046","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00ebl\u00d7rvenvevor: Threnin i y\u00ebl\u00d7\u00d3tarven \u00d1etib t