y\u00ebl\u00d7\u00d3f\u00ebr zem venor i d\u00c7\u00d3 h\u00c5b\u00cdizya."}]},{"blockId":"block.54bd76bf50ba4458bef5033583e31e41","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.267","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00ebl\u00d7ma: minel\u2019m\u00e7 y\u00ebl y\u00c9nenimowfu t\u00d7 var\u00dfn\u2019i d\u00c7\u00d3."}]},{"blockId":"block.42bc5ae5984d43f5aae0932641381543","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.316","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Al d\u00c7vun i Huram \u00e3\u00d1 d\u00c7vun i \u00daelom\u00c5n \u00d1etib azarget tha Ofir y\u00c9nenizya y\u00ebl\u00d7ma y\u00eblverzetun \u00e3\u00d1 minel kwestaunget y\u00c9nenizya."}]},{"blockId":"block.cc7319fee6da4856976640555c3dc111","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.436","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00ebl\u00d7make\u00dbon: H\u00c5b\u00cden i y\u00ebl\u00d7ma \u00d1etib ni p\u00e1f\u00d7\u2019m\u00e7 gl\u00c9stvoren marin m\u00d7s \u00e5vimowya."}]},{"blockId":"block.65488cbe528c46fda34ac4e399f7c3f2","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.513","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Vorn\u2019m\u00e7 gl\u00c9stvoren thav \u00e7ztimizya. Pel ni p\u00e1f\u00d7\u2019m\u00e7 gl\u00c9stvoren y\u00ebl\u00d7make\u00dbon gl\u00c9stizya."}]},{"blockId":"block.a14e3303b0fe452098558fd94be1a51f","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.597","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00ebl\u00d7maake\u00dbon: Y\u00ebl\u00d7ma \u00d1etib t\u00d7 venor jem\u00e3imowya vinto h\u00c5b\u00cd\u2019m\u00e7 w\u00cf\u00dfen broftimowya."}]},{"blockId":"block.6c1559197c71472bb8bf26dfff1c4df5","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.677","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Za y\u00ebl\u00d7maake\u00dbon f\u00c5wizya \u00e3\u00d1 rav \u00d1etib l\u00e1mgl\u00c9st po \u00e3lumatya s\u00eb\u00dbgaizya."}]},{"blockId":"block.d2792ac1885f4003a009800239d94125","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.746","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00ebl\u00d7maden: Neks w\u00c5vumen i y\u00ebl\u00d7ma \u00d1etib w\u00cf\u00dfen miktaz\u00d7rs\u00dflumowya p\u00e1n l\u00e1mgl\u00c9st t\u00e7lowya."}]},{"blockId":"block.2e0e1bc414fe42a7879e9ed440e8e01f","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.831","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"R\u00e1 broft venim ma\u2019s\u00c7fizya. \u00caers y\u00ebl\u00d7maden r\u00e1 \u00d1etib w\u00cf\u00dfen ef\u2019w\u00cf\u00df h\u00c5b\u00cdizya."}]},{"blockId":"block.bc738b5b8bcf445996d5209cc4290189","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.905","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00ebl\u00d7n: y\u00eblverzet."}]},{"blockId":"block.ae1d515cd36742478f9ded3bd9ccf48f","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.923","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"K\u00e3m grel y\u00ebl\u00d7n y\u00eblverzet zi dlenizya \u00e3\u00d1 se\u00dbizya o\u00c3 prodnargaz\u00e9ms\u00dflum ziget vorilizya \u00e3\u00d1 \u00e5\u00c3 zi tondaizya: Ner\u00c3\u00cde \u00e3\u00d1 weme."}]},{"blockId":"block.9c530da5d2bb4b46adacb08c9d6c5c4f","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1044","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00ebl\u00d7np\u00e1in: Y\u00ebl\u00d7n \u00d1etib kin marin ef\u2019verzet tav ragumowya."}]},{"blockId":"block.aa595716b52a48128a8c83cfa99ba82e","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1102","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Lym kin p\u00e1in ma\u2019\u00c7pibaizya. Vin y\u00ebl\u00d7np\u00e1in t\u00e7lizya vorny\u00cd\u00d7 vorn\u2019m\u00e7 ragum\u00e7l\u00d7ono\u00c3t\u00e7 tar\u00d5izya."}]},{"blockId":"block.6c5998887bc443b693ce235f5da2c33c","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1192","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00ebl\u00d7nvevor: Threnin i y\u00ebl\u00d7n \u00d1etib t\u00d7 thavvimna f\u00ebr jem\u00e3imowya."}]},{"blockId":"block.770d4ba77c4c434b97283cbc7770fcc3","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1255","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Zem gimam y\u00ebl\u00d7n \u00e7ztizya. R\u00e1 y\u00ebl\u00d7nvevor t\u00d7 thavvimna venal jem\u00e3izya."}]},{"blockId":"block.89ac9e46de4c429fa4ee01ae308aa744","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1323","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00ebl\u00d7nf\u00ebr: \u00e2lum i y\u00ebl\u00d7n \u00d1etib venor i d\u00c7\u00d3 gl\u00c9stowya."}]},{"blockId":"block.3a6686df11e64a388bccc88bdccfad12","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1375","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Gren tav\u00ebr y\u00ebl\u00d7n \u00e3lumizya. \u00caers y\u00ebl\u00d7nf\u00ebr zem venor i d\u00c7\u00d3 h\u00c5b\u00cdizya."}]},{"blockId":"block.fa22f70d14ab43d4983df41360e146a2","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1442","langu