3lumizya. \u00caers y\u00ebl\u00d7\u00dbf\u00ebr zem venor i d\u00c7\u00d3 h\u00c5b\u00cdizya."}]},{"blockId":"block.8d26ce9f7c634297aec86295665a628b","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.431","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00ebll\u00c3aheginv\u00d7: Ton i y\u00ebllunivel murlametw\u00c5vum jem\u00e3\u2019en \u00c3ahe \u00e5\u00c3 vesna s\u00dflum kom ka zem zem\u2019falnthren o\u00c3owya."}]},{"blockId":"block.fecb1c471d5c4a378117eab33d866226","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.538","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Nemir r\u00e1\u2019falnthren o\u00c3izya \u00e3\u00d1 y\u00ebll\u00c3aheginv\u00d7 f\u00c5wizya. Neks r\u00e1 po matondizya rav tav w\u00c5vumizya."}]},{"blockId":"block.22b260d0fccf4f469913c704552b90d6","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.631","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00ebll\u00c3ahefaren: Falnthren i \u00d1etib y\u00ebllunivel murlametw\u00c5vum jem\u00e3\u2019en \u00c3ahe giktenv\u00d7owya vin ni \u00d5\u00dfr fradowya."}]},{"blockId":"block.854c77df82f6411ab570302b81ab96e9","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.736","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Ni venor mavem y\u00ebllunivel murlametw\u00c5vum jem\u00e3\u2019en \u00c3ahe tondaizya. H\u00ebthven lym ly\u2019k\u00cfba\u00d1 y\u00ebll\u00c3ahefaren portimostizya."}]},{"blockId":"block.94769dc4f30f453992b6be85829a1c37","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.850","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00ebll\u00c3ahesef\u00c7\u00c3: Falnthren i y\u00ebllunivel murlametw\u00c5vum jem\u00e3\u2019en \u00c3ahe \u00d1etib tav fradowya \u00e3\u00d1 ni venor t\u00d7 p\u00e1f\u00d7\u2019m\u00e7 nerbyal portimostimowya."}]},{"blockId":"block.1d69ddeed73a459cba4cbc93a2b75024","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.982","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Neks venor h\u00ebth falnthren lym h\u00c5b\u00cdpomizya. Venyel y\u00ebll\u00c3ahesef\u00c7\u00c3 p\u00e1n ly\u2019broft t\u00e7lizya."}]},{"blockId":"block.e88dd32ab2914f8a97a4de6d008f7a6b","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1068","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00ebllenir: y\u00ebl lenir."}]},{"blockId":"block.d195f602dd114d38b550022813beea18","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1089","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Vimin y\u00ebldest\u00eb\u00c5 tha teral \u00e7zt\u2019jw\u00ebnowya \u00e3\u00d1 elyi\u00d1\u2019es y\u00ebllenir a\u00d9owya."}]},{"blockId":"block.961fc484ea5542e0a8535c2552943220","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1157","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00ebllenirvejem: Den gren y\u00ebllenir \u00d1etib tremb\u00c5r thrin venor\u2019m\u00e7 \u00e5v a\u00d9owya."}]},{"blockId":"block.39227ef6d2844604be605f050b8547a2","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1230","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"\u00d2\u00c5tus y\u00ebllenir ilna\u2019m\u00e7 \u00d3\u00e1lun\u00c3izya. Ni y\u00ebllenirvejem r\u00e1\u2019mela h\u00c5b\u00cdizya \u00d1etib za\u2019k\u00cfba\u00d1 r\u00d7izya."}]},{"blockId":"block.d8d6f25c874d423db290fc2f0c3e6afe","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1322","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00ebllenirvesna: \u00d0et \u00d1etib ni \u00e7l\u00d7on i y\u00ebllenir po\u2019d\u00c7\u00d3 f\u00d7owya."}]},{"blockId":"block.5602b6d67c41495aa27aef6c222a6e61","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1382","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Y\u00ebllenir b\u00e9rvimizya. Vinto po t\u00d7y\u00dfb\u00dfimizya y\u00ebllenirvesna ly\u2019d\u00c7\u00d3 \u00db\u00c7dizya."}]},{"blockId":"block.4fddd4de0f584eecb1c9b1ce676a7781","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1455","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00ebllenirfader: Y\u00ebllenir \u00d1etib h\u00ebth a\u00d9s\u00dflum \u00c3\u00cdthavowya \u00cbers tremb\u00c5run i k\u00cfba\u00d1s\u00dflumun venim d\u00c7\u00d3owya."}]},{"blockId":"block.19ffb84f12cd423492f4c8ce0ab47e2e","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1554","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"A\u00d9s\u00dflum venor\u2019m\u00e7 venor thav r\u00d7izya. Lym venik\u2019t threnin \u00e3lumizya \u00e3\u00d1 y\u00ebllenirfader tav \u00e5vizya."}]},{"blockId":"block.47a6d3a95ffd417f93632dfac745a8a8","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1648","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00ebllunivel murlametw\u00c5vum jem\u00e3\u2019en \u00c3ahe: Murlameth\u00c5b\u00cdpomna\u2019m\u00e7 den "}]}]}]},"styleFeatures":{"style.body":{"kern":true,"liga":true}},"characters":[{"start":0,"end":9,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":10,"end":32,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":33,"end":90,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start"