none","text":"Neks venor h\u00ebth falnthren lym h\u00c5b\u00cdpomizya. Venyel y\u00eblsowyasef\u00c7\u00c3 p\u00e1n ly\u2019broft t\u00e7lizya."}]},{"blockId":"block.1c91367ce9e949638926f31c691e179e","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.238","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00ebl\u00db\u00d7m: 1 y\u00eblverzet falibi y\u00eblenun t\u00d7 jemekjem\u00e3 z\u00dfgu\u00d9imowya."}]},{"blockId":"block.d5b0b74fd4684bb98df5a216da7121cc","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.299","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Ni \u00e7l\u00d7on i kranin y\u00eblvar ner t\u00e7latya \u00e3\u00d1 ni \u00e7l\u00d7on i kraninthesil y\u00ebl\u00db\u00d7m ner t\u00e7latya \u00e3\u00d1 po \u00e5\u00c3 Denarvenek t\u00d7 den t\u00d7 vinolthav jelam \u00d1etib thav ma\u2019dest\u00eb\u00c5imatya r\u00d7atya."}]},{"blockId":"block.16933e55bce34d6fa21d109bf74b2866","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.463","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"2 vimin\u2019m\u00e7 y\u00eblverzet r\u00c7n\u00d3 mel\u2019m\u00e7 y\u00ebletun."}]},{"blockId":"block.04938edc408440bdb046cb68f7794ef0","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.505","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Nerinven t\u00d7 zi\u2019vennerbun kom vimin r\u00d7izya r\u00e1 k\u00e3m venser\u2019nivil gren y\u00ebl\u00db\u00d7m\u2019y\u00eblet \u00e5\u00c3 zi\u2019goren\u2019m\u00e7 mer r\u00d7owya."}]},{"blockId":"block.c5cd3c0e47ed45618afaedc7621d424b","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.612","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00ebl\u00db\u00d7mp\u00e1in: Y\u00ebl\u00db\u00d7m \u00d1etib kin marin ef\u2019verzet tav ragumowya."}]},{"blockId":"block.18972bb23bd849e4a3ff6e05c02c10cf","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.672","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Lym kin p\u00e1in ma\u2019\u00c7pibaizya. Vin y\u00ebl\u00db\u00d7mp\u00e1in t\u00e7lizya vorny\u00cd\u00d7 vorn\u2019m\u00e7 ragum\u00e7l\u00d7ono\u00c3t\u00e7 tar\u00d5izya."}]},{"blockId":"block.c6a79664b2ec43a8a00fa8c59a0b2a8d","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.763","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00ebl\u00db\u00d7mvevor: Threnin i y\u00ebl\u00db\u00d7m \u00d1etib t\u00d7 thavvimna f\u00ebr jem\u00e3imowya."}]},{"blockId":"block.9bac1551d1164d09a51520fae548114a","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.828","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Zem gimam y\u00ebl\u00db\u00d7m \u00e7ztizya. R\u00e1 y\u00ebl\u00db\u00d7mvevor t\u00d7 thavvimna venal jem\u00e3izya."}]},{"blockId":"block.31f989e5c12343d88147e8c3ada4a619","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.898","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00ebl\u00db\u00d7mf\u00ebr: \u00e2lum i y\u00ebl\u00db\u00d7m \u00d1etib venor i d\u00c7\u00d3 gl\u00c9stowya."}]},{"blockId":"block.3469bdee4cbd4d08884cc171d5e63d67","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.952","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Gren tav\u00ebr y\u00ebl\u00db\u00d7m \u00e3lumizya. \u00caers y\u00ebl\u00db\u00d7mf\u00ebr zem venor i d\u00c7\u00d3 h\u00c5b\u00cdizya."}]},{"blockId":"block.75024f72cdb546d18a224ef146f7f47b","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1021","languageId":