.qt.769","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"R\u00e1un ni var\u00ebljo\u00d9 y\u00ebl\u00c5rget y\u00eblj\u00d7m y\u00eblverzetget y\u00ebl\u00db\u00d7mget \u00e3\u00d1 melyem y\u00eblverzetget verzetatya r\u00e1un ni farvemen y\u00eblvar y\u00eblverzetget \u00e3\u00d1 y\u00eblj\u00d7nget \u00e3\u00d1 y\u00ebl\u00ddmget n\u00d7\u00dbem hy\u00c5v\u00cdatya."}]},{"blockId":"block.10ae32a72b6845d392b6d356007b21d1","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.938","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00ebl\u00ddmp\u00e1in: Y\u00ebl\u00ddm \u00d1etib kin marin ef\u2019verzet tav ragumowya."}]},{"blockId":"block.30630547d88e4af0b07d96fb23a4244b","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.996","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Lym kin p\u00e1in ma\u2019\u00c7pibaizya. Vin y\u00ebl\u00ddmp\u00e1in t\u00e7lizya vorny\u00cd\u00d7 vorn\u2019m\u00e7 ragum\u00e7l\u00d7ono\u00c3t\u00e7 tar\u00d5izya."}]},{"blockId":"block.3f7f2db25b3e46659936d5648c052d62","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1086","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00ebl\u00ddmvevor: Threnin i y\u00ebl\u00ddm \u00d1etib t\u00d7 thavvimna f\u00ebr jem\u00e3imowya."}]},{"blockId":"block.48206b17c5fb448b90d9abaef8449c7f","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1149","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Zem gimam y\u00ebl\u00ddm \u00e7ztizya. R\u00e1 y\u00ebl\u00ddmvevor t\u00d7 thavvimna venal jem\u00e3izya."}]},{"blockId":"block.c64531336c2942b1936a566c9e740ff7","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1217","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.bod