y\u00eblyrbra\u00cb\u00cdnon grasnotizya. Yib\u2019\u00ebw rav za vel veritasizya."}]},{"blockId":"block.4045f89b002a460e96087c4f78640e00","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.914","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblyrbraveerb: Y\u00eblyemarbra \u00d1etib s\u00dflum \u00cbers nerbyal f\u00d7owya \u00e3\u00d1 t\u00d7 \u00d1etib broft\u2019jw\u00ebnowya."}]},{"blockId":"block.46f4d23efb9045e58863d948515a1571","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1001","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Vesna tremb\u00c5r ilna\u2019m\u00e7 falnthren \u00cbers vengraf f\u00d7izya. R\u00e1\u2019y\u00eblyrbraveerb r\u00e1 p\u00e1n s\u00ebvenun nerbyalizya."}]},{"blockId":"block.92e9c2c2cd8b4ca99dc9a1a65ec82459","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1099","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblyrbrain\u00dfb\u00df: Y\u00eblyemarbra k\u00e3m vesna s\u00dflum nerbyalizya f\u00d7\u2019en p\u00c7n\u00df\u00eb t\u00d7 k\u00cfba\u00d1\u2019m\u00e7 f\u00c7l broft\u2019en."}]},{"blockId":"block.257b53be3e4446979390fa5bdef2f159","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1192","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Nerbyal za\u2019k\u00cfba\u00d1 r\u00d7izya. R\u00c7n\u00d3 r\u00e1\u2019tremb\u00c5r r\u00e1 y\u00eblyrbrain\u00dfb\u00dfizya \u00e3\u00d1 t\u00d7 murlametw\u00c5vum r\u00e1 broftizya."}]},{"blockId":"block.dad7dca608e1417eb77a914c17aa7db0","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1288","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblyrda\u00c3vejem: Den gren y\u00eblyemaryems\u00d7 nerda\u00c3 \u00d1etib tremb\u00c5r thrin venor\u2019m\u00e7 \u00e5v a\u00d9owya."}]},{"blockId":"block.7fa19758eeb24c1bb734cc87271587e7","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1373","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"\u00d2\u00c5tus y\u00eblyemaryems\u00d7 nerda\u00c3 ilna\u2019m\u00e7 \u00d3\u00e1lun\u00c3izya. Ni y\u00eblyrda\u00c3vejem r\u00e1\u2019mela h\u00c5b\u00cdizya \u00d1etib za\u2019k\u00cfba\u00d1 r\u00d7izya."}]},{"blockId":"block.070f0321b64c4dcbb7af3d87349b711b","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1477","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblyrda\u00c3vesna: \u00d0et \u00d1etib ni \u00e7l\u00d7on i y\u00eblyemaryems\u00d7 nerda\u00c3 po\u2019d\u00c7\u00d3 f\u00d7owya."}]},{"blockId":"block.77e1c719da9b4acf93aa6ee641a1bd54","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1549","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Y\u00eblyemaryems\u00d7 nerda\u00c3 b\u00e9rvimizya. Vinto po t\u00d7y\u00dfb\u00dfimizya y\u00eblyrda\u00c3vesna ly\u2019d\u00c7\u00d3 "}]}]}]},"styleFeatures":{"style.body":{"kern":true,"liga":true}},"characters":[{"start":0,"end":13,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":14,"end":38,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":39,"end":134,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":135,"end":230,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":231,"end":306,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":307,"end":401,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":402,"end":464,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":465,"end":540,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":541,"end":642,"attribute