paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.36","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblyrda\u00c3fader: Y\u00eblyemaryems\u00d7 nerda\u00c3 \u00d1etib h\u00ebth a\u00d9s\u00dflum \u00c3\u00cdthavowya \u00cbers tremb\u00c5run i k\u00cfba\u00d1s\u00dflumun venim d\u00c7\u00d3owya."}]},{"blockId":"block.4c5f079dd74643b595c2d89476535fbf","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.147","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"A\u00d9s\u00dflum venor\u2019m\u00e7 venor thav r\u00d7izya. Lym venik\u2019t threnin \u00e3lumizya \u00e3\u00d1 y\u00eblyrda\u00c3fader tav \u00e5vizya."}]},{"blockId":"block.3cb953cda4214884ae192cfe381a9a63","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.241","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblyrgurgi\u00cden: Y\u00eblyemargur vin threnins\u00dflumun r\u00c7n\u00d3 neksus giktenv\u00d7j\u00cden falnthrenowya."}]},{"blockId":"block.9d6a8189b3c6488d8d88b82ede3d6b04","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.327","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Ol ven\u2019m\u00e7 r\u00d7izya. Yib\u2019\u00ebw h\u00ebth ikamo\u00d1ton y\u00eblyrgurgi\u00cden broftizya."}]},{"blockId":"block.fdd90453ddb14689aa7fdf38bdbd9c84","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.392","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblyrgurthren: S\u00dflumun thavvim y\u00eblyemargur falibi d\u00c7\u00d3 r\u00c7n\u00d3 po kl\u00e1rimowya venka den ma\u2019\u00ddvimowya."}]},{"blockId":"block.d2f0a9f9f4c34a57999381dc556ddb65","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.488","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Nor\u00d3aint\u00dff\u00c9ben zyrizya. Rav lym y\u00eblyrgurthren \u00d3\u00c5\u00e7izya t\u00d7 zem\u2019d\u00c7\u00d3 gimer tarenizya."}]},{"blockId":"block.6e2a927a4dae4862be1d53742fe4eda3","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.570","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblyrgurneyal: Y\u00eblyemargur falibi threnins\u00dflumun \u00c3\u00cd\u2019jw\u00ebnizya p\u00c7n\u00df\u00eb t\u00d7 \u00d1e\u00d5 d\u00c7\u00d3 dlen\u00dbeminizya."}]},{"blockId":"block.0116fa601e384bf1820f01feda544ab0","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.663","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Daral \u00c5el\u2019m\u00e7 r\u00d7izya. Lym tav tarenizya yib\u2019\u00ebw \u00d1ed falib dlen\u00dbeminizya. \u00d0em y\u00eblyrgurneyal r\u00d7izya."}]},{"blockId":"block.16d0c999ac534835b53965e9440387dd","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.760","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblyrvenke\u00dbon: H\u00c5b\u00cden i y\u00eblyemarmarven \u00d1etib ni p\u00e1f\u00d7\u2019m\u00e7 gl\u00c9stvoren marin m\u00d7s \u00e5vimowya."}]},{"blockId":"block.be17705876864adfb81a1e69735b6bcb","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.847","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Vorn\u2019m\u00e7 gl\u00c9stvoren thav \u00e7ztimizya. Pel ni p\u00e1f\u00d7\u2019m\u00e7 gl\u00c9stvoren y\u00eblyrvenke\u00dbon gl\u00c9stizya."}]},{"blockId":"block.a290c0fa91154677a7c4bc8a40df5e52","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.933","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblyrvena\u00cb\u00cdnon: S\u00dflum falib d\u00c7\u00d3 i y\u00eblyemarmarjo\u00d9marven vingim f\u00d7owya p\u00e1n arventhrenden mlapv\u00d7staowya."}]},{"blockId":"block.a5d184021a18417b81e5ade842a3bfcb","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1035","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Gren nor\u00d3aint\u00dff\u00c9ben vesna den kojizya. Vin d\u00c7\u00d3 t\u00e7lizya ol \u00e5\u00c3 y\u00eblyrvena\u00cb\u00cdnon elyi\u00d1izya."}]},{"blockId":"block.290301aa047d4f9f890a4c690639cf91","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1122","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblyrvenalarod: Y\u00eblyemarmarjo\u00d9marven \u00e5\u00c3 falib s\u00dflumun jw\u00ebnenplesten\u2019m\u00e7 d\u00c7\u00d3 \u00cbers lamprod y\u00c9nenowya."}]},{"blockId":"block.f74200b1c3a342d9b3bd74d52b74da6a","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1221","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Neks den gren nor\u00d3aint\u00dff\u00c9ben vesna\u2019m\u00e7 r\u00d7izya. T\u00d7 jw\u00ebnenplesten\u2019m\u00e7 voren zem ni dar\u00c5el i y\u00eblyrvenalarod wa\u00d9gumizya."}]},{"blockId":"block.609001658f224b238ec8d900b0b0ffe1","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1336","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblyrvenanoven: S\u00dflum falib d\u00c7\u00d3 i y\u00eblyemarmarjo\u00d9marven t\u00d7 vimin\u2019m\u00e7 venor ni po\u2019\u00e7l\u00d7on f\u00d7owya."}]},{"blockId":"block.039aeeb6331745a5a2ed5b7be4f2f353","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1429","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Y\u00eblyemarmarjo\u00d9marven sezif\u00c7\u00c3izya. Y\u00eblyrvenanoven taren f\u00c5wizya \u00e3\u00d1 braden sezif\u00c7\u00c3izya."}]},{"blockId":"block.ad665994d3f04818bd345316ab3c5325","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1515","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblyrven\u00cb\u00cdnon: S\u00dflum falib d\u00c7\u00d3 i y\u00eblyemard\u00c7\u00d3s\u00dflum threnina\u00d9inst\u00dfb\u00df marven "}]}]}]},"styleFeatures":{"style.body":{"kern":true,"liga":true}},"characters":[{"start":0,"end":13,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":14,"end":35,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":36,"end":146,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":147,"end":240,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":241,"end":326,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":327,"end":391,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":392,"end":487,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":488,"end":569,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":570,"end":662,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":663,"end":759,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":760,"end":846,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":847,"end":932,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":933,"end":1034,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":1035,"end":1121,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":1122,"end":1220,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":1221,"end":1335,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":1336,"end":1428,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":1429,"end":1514,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpa