s y\u00eblyemarmarven ilna\u2019m\u00e7 \u00d3\u00e1lun\u00c3izya. Ni y\u00eblyrvenvejem r\u00e1\u2019mela h\u00c5b\u00cdizya \u00d1etib za\u2019k\u00cfba\u00d1 r\u00d7izya."}]},{"blockId":"block.2815f4791b6f421880414b63d2495c23","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.337","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblyrvenfader: Y\u00eblyemarmarven \u00d1etib h\u00ebth a\u00d9s\u00dflum \u00c3\u00cdthavowya \u00cbers tremb\u00c5run i k\u00cfba\u00d1s\u00dflumun venim d\u00c7\u00d3owya."}]},{"blockId":"block.caf0c0520ee54f869d948e1a7fc6a866","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.442","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"A\u00d9s\u00dflum venor\u2019m\u00e7 venor thav r\u00d7izya. Lym venik\u2019t threnin \u00e3lumizya \u00e3\u00d1 y\u00eblyrvenfader tav \u00e5vizya."}]},{"blockId":"block.334d822c232d424081016bf962db89fe","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.536","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblyrvenlarod: Y\u00eblyemard\u00c7\u00d3s\u00dflum threnina\u00d9inst\u00dfb\u00df marven \u00e5\u00c3 falib s\u00dflumun jw\u00ebnenplesten\u2019m\u00e7 d\u00c7\u00d3 \u00cbers lamprod y\u00c9nenowya."}]},{"blockId":"block.b93d6f04c6bd4b14a13864b315f7a4fc","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.654","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Neks den gren nor\u00d3aint\u00dff\u00c9ben vesna\u2019m\u00e7 r\u00d7izya. T\u00d7 jw\u00ebnenplesten\u2019m\u00e7 voren zem ni dar\u00c5el i y\u00eblyrvenlarod wa\u00d9gumizya."}]},{"blockId":"block.4e578fa02d884c109495e2dd3ba9518d","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.768","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblyrvennoven: S\u00dflum falib d\u00c7\u00d3 i y\u00eblyemard\u00c7\u00d3s\u00dflum threnina\u00d9inst\u00dfb\u00df marven t\u00d7 vimin\u2019m\u00e7 venor ni po\u2019\u00e7l\u00d7on f\u00d7owya."}]},{"blockId":"block.b1ef8cf1724f45e7852b17422ef0f61a","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.880","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Y\u00eblyemard\u00c7\u00d3s\u00dflum threnina\u00d9inst\u00dfb\u00df marven sezif\u00c7\u00c3izya. Y\u00eblyrvennoven taren f\u00c5wizya \u00e3\u00d1 braden sezif\u00c7\u00c3izya."}]},{"blockId":"block.5cb707c31c4643849a6c8df50447f03c","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.985","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblyb\u00cden\u00cb\u00cdnon: Y\u00eblyemarmarjo\u00d9h\u00c5b\u00cden \u00d1etib \u00cbers venor\u2019m\u00e7 \u00cb\u00cdnon marin p\u00e1f\u00d7\u2019m\u00e7 w\u00c5vumen f\u00d7imowya."}]},{"blockId":"block.42583f83181d447fb789dfcd8de0fdb4","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1079","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Vinel pel giktenv\u00d7izya za\u2019tremb\u00c5r y\u00eblyb\u00cden\u00cb\u00cdnon grasnotizya. Yib\u2019\u00ebw rav za vel veritasizya."}]},{"blockId":"block.2929f6d2371a4988b9fee7356166480e","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1171","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblyb\u00cdenveerb: Y\u00eblyemarmarjo\u00d9h\u00c5b\u00cden \u00d1etib s\u00dflum \u00cbers nerbyal f\u00d7owya \u00e3\u00d1 t\u00d7 \u00d1etib broft\u2019jw\u00ebnowya."}]},{"blockId":"block.926dc752056a472ca99ac7989b0387d1","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1267","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Vesna tremb\u00c5r ilna\u2019m\u00e7 falnthren \u00cbers vengraf f\u00d7izya. R\u00e1\u2019y\u00eblyb\u00cdenveerb r\u00e1 p\u00e1n s\u00ebvenun nerbyalizya."}]},{"blockId":"block.4a93c63ee444492a9c0d8ba1c9f3dccc","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1365","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblyb\u00cdenin\u00dfb\u00df: Y\u00eblyemarmarjo\u00d9h\u00c5b\u00cden k\u00e3m vesna s\u00dflum nerbyalizya f\u00d7\u2019en p\u00c7n\u00df\u00eb t\u00d7 k\u00cfba\u00d1\u2019m\u00e7 f\u00c7l broft\u2019en."}]},{"blockId":"block.25aa7966a66d46b2b879417769231b09","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1467","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Nerbyal za\u2019k\u00cfba\u00d1 r\u00d7izya. R\u00c7n\u00d3 r\u00e1\u2019tremb\u00c5r r\u00e1 y\u00eblyb\u00cdenin\u00dfb\u00dfizya \u00e3\u00d1 t\u00d7 murlametw\u00c5vum r\u00e1 broftizya."}]},{"blockId":"block.60532b85f58b4e0a829bb208d4451492","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1563","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblygrenk\u00e3men: Y\u00eblyemargren k\u00e3m r\u00c7n\u00d3 thavvim\u2019m\u00e7 \u00d1etun k\u00e3menimowya."}]}]}]},"styleFeatures":{"style.body":{"kern":true,"liga":true}},"characters":[{"start":0,"end":13,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":14,"end":73,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":74,"end":159,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":160,"end":238,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":239,"end":336,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":337,"end":441,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing