ction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.348","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblyemar gl\u00c9z\u00cben kranzar: y\u00eblyemar gl\u00c9z\u00cben kranzar."}]},{"blockId":"block.1ba43aa68c0447f68c8138af09631e8f","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.400","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Far y\u00eblyemar gl\u00c9z\u00cben kranzar\u2019en f\u00c5wowya dur\u00ebn nerinmem ilmem lomih gim venla\u00ebw vel \u00c3\u00cd\u2019es r\u00d7\u2019jorowya, t\u00d7 thimel nilthar gren zem\u2019y\u00eblyemarthiren \u00e7l\u00d7onun tha s\u00dfrnven terastimowya y\u00eblyemarun."}]},{"blockId":"block.317360f204164616acf7e39d3d1f49d9","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.588","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblyemar marven \u00d3\u00c5tus\u2019t: y\u00eblyemar marven \u00d3\u00c5tus\u2019t."}]},{"blockId":"block.d1982349ec5a4c458a7d085ee683eacb","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.638","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"T\u00d7 gimolvimin murlamet hefak gurs\u00dflum\u00e1pe\u00dbem haren Swan ni olven p\u00e1n Mindanao s\u00dflum murtarizya zi\u2019s\u00dflum. Grafvenor yib\u2019\u00ebw murf\u00d7sezif\u00c7\u00c3 t\u00d7 w\u00c5vumowya r\u00e1, k\u00e3m r\u00c7n\u00d3 marven Tit zi\u2019haren y\u00eblyemar marven \u00d3\u00c5tus\u2019t falib b\u00cfeb\u00d3\u00c5\u00e7 hefak gurs\u00dflum\u00e1pe\u00dbem haren k\u00e3m Mindanao \u00e5\u00c3 t\u00e7lh\u00eb\u00d5izfu."}]},{"blockId":"block.5161e57c543b4351a9fe409db819a1e4","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.911","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblyemarjem\u00e3: y\u00eblyemar jem\u00e3."}]},{"blockId":"block.afa8054b3fe1479cafa3c5f5c0911c9c","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.940","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Y\u00eblyemarun kin y\u00eblyemargl\u00c9z\u00cben tarnowya vin gorenjo\u00d9 thavvim dlenowya, goryemsjo\u00d9 thani ni y\u00cd\u00d7goren thavren vut\u2019es. Y\u00eblyemarjem\u00e3 zeth goryems vorel jo\u00d9 grelna r\u00d7owya. Vimin jo\u00d9 ningi r\u00dfv naor naorjo\u00d9olun h\u00ebthin kojowya."}]},{"blockId":"block.bc17be53b6c14f31a8b6dd8cc4b73091","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1160","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblyemarjo\u00d9shal: y\u00eblyemar jo\u00d9shal."}]},{"blockId":"block.c64dec9bd4da4304953fd4b73ed3bb6f","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1195","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"P\u00c7n\u00df\u00eb neks ufolimizya \u00e7l\u00d7on tha da\u00c3\u2019en grafel komna B\u00d7\u00c7r vingraf ma\u2019o\u00c3izya r\u00e1, gren y\u00eblyemarjo\u00d9shal maves, k\u00c7nib elenol yems\u00d7ner\u00c3\u00cd poget grem yemyatowya."}]},{"blockId":"block.7c238a4f30f049289cb55174333ef9e1","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1349","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblyemar\u00c3efah: Neks den i y\u00eblyemar p\u00e1n ol\u2019m\u00e7 falnthren h\u00c5b\u00cdimowya."}]},{"blockId":"block.57975ee4bfdc40e6816c3d883a430476","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1416","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Pel y\u00eblyemar\u00c3efah o\u00c3izya p\u00e1n vorny\u00cd\u00d7 y\u00eblyemar denizya."}]},{"blockId":"block.cc2b9a4d51654c129f846ad78c6284b9","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1471","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblyemarkinem: y\u00eblyemar kinem."}]},{"blockId":"block.e15db2e4a74c4f60b78b5bb3faa753e4","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1502","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Elin\u00ebw goren y\u00eblyemarkinem s\u00c7fizya po; kinos prodnaklojvor \u00e3\u00d1 zarunfalnthren\u2019es b\u00d7\u00c7rborel r\u00d7izya. Yib\u2019\u00ebw yib ni veritasizya r\u00e1 \u00e3\u00d1 prod\u00e7zt ma\u2019o\u00c3izya."}]},{"blockId":"block.a5bedb763d434983ab40c533207858f6","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1651","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblyemarkoj: y\u00eblyemar koj."}]},{"blockId":"block.e9da637eb7a64bfa9765d336e98fce80","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1678","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Jem\u00e3ma\u00e5v haren naorthrenin y\u00eblyemarkoj dest\u00eb\u00c5izya ly \u00e3\u00d1 y\u00eblyemar dur\u00ebn shalen\u2019en y\u00eblshalinun kerdest\u00eb\u00c5s\u00ebnalizya ly; t\u00d7 Mindanao ni ol na ma\u2019shalenimizya po, \u00e3\u00d1 rav gren vutimizfu vorn y\u00eblshalinun ven yemsinin thavizya ly \u00e3\u00d1 p\u00e1f\u00d7un gren \u00c7pibaizya."}]},{"blockId":"block.4fb3c426273d4a3fbaea48a6b0ffcfa5","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1925","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblyemaravesna: \u00d0et \u00d1etib ni \u00e7l\u00d7on i y\u00eblyemarviminy\u00eblyemar po\u2019d\u00c7\u00d3 f\u00d7owya."}]},{"blockId":"block.1012c1ca48704976a6d27a637ae00ec0","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1999","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Y\u00eblyemarviminy\u00eblyemar b\u00e9rvimizya. Vinto po t\u00d7y\u00dfb\u00dfimizya y\u00eblyemaravesna ly\u2019d\u00c7\u00d3 "}]}]}]},"styleFeatures":{"style.body":{"kern":true,"liga":true}},"characters":[{"start":0,"end":28,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":29,"end":43,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":44,"end":140,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":141,"end":192,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":193,"end":347,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":348,"end":399,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":400,"end":587,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":588,"end":637,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":638,"end":910,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":911,"end":939,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":940,"end":1159,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":1160,"end":1194,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":1195,"end":1348,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":1349,"end":1415,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":1416,"end":1470,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":1471,"end":1501,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":1502,"end":1650,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":1651,"end":1677,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":1678,"end":1924,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{