,"runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.210","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblyemarr\u00c7n\u00d3vem: y\u00eblyemar r\u00c7n\u00d3vem."}]},{"blockId":"block.f38131c145bf42aab7cecd6da601eda7","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.245","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Yems\u00d7 plestizya zem vin Venor \u00e7ztizya r\u00e1, rav \u00d3\u00c5tusthrenin y\u00eblyemar y\u00eblyemarr\u00c7n\u00d3vem merthrengren r\u00d7\u2019es; ol \u00d1em f\u00d7\u2019en po gim \u00c9lm t\u00d7y\u00dfb\u00dfizya r\u00e1."}]},{"blockId":"block.6ec08b31cd0a46598a9a8c76b9bbade5","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.388","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblyemarr\u00ddy\u00d3s\u00dflum: y\u00eblyemar r\u00ddy\u00d3s\u00dflum."}]},{"blockId":"block.0ca114dd9e124fe4af9c2fe7148199d7","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.427","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Kinos tha Salagwa ner\u00e7ztowya vinto jo\u00d9thren thrin enifelenowya po, kinos Meshiko z\u00e1lagur \u00e5\u00c3 kl\u00e1rjem y\u00eblyemarr\u00ddy\u00d3s\u00dflumunget merthrengren hy\u00c5v\u00cdowya po."}]},{"blockId":"block.467bfd6538024a9b9c7e2ecfe32aac8e","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.577","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblyemarbra: 1 bra."}]},{"blockId":"block.1f25c75ffa32444baf2de80e046245ad","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.597","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"P\u00e1n r\u00ddy\u00d3 y\u00eblyemarget zem y\u00eblyemarbraizya."}]},{"blockId":"block.01d989057db34ffe894ae8fa97bcb815","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.639","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"2 bra."}]},{"blockId":"block.a29bebb9df754734b4566ae563c135df","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.646","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"K\u00e3nib bra\u00ebw y\u00eblyemarbraimizfu \u00e3\u00d1 r\u00c7n\u00d3 k\u00ebrmelun shalenimizfu r\u00d7owya po. Goryems ner tarnizya poget?"}]},{"blockId":"block.125a1385fb8142f8bf6bb24f1ecbf7b6","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.745","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblyemardarummem: y\u00eblyemar darum mem."}]},{"blockId":"block.1189b2b2c9724c529d1848a2be1f61b6","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.783","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"P\u00e1n \u00db\u00d7b\u00dfizfu vimar p\u00e1l\u00dfn, yems\u00d7 gren shalin dlenowya \u00d1etib, drig\u00e1l\u2019en lomih y\u00eblyemarun \u00e5\u00c3 yems\u00d7 \u00db\u00c7d\u2019en lomih kom \u00e5vimowya, elen Venor \u00d3\u00c5tusthrenin y\u00eblyemardarummem lomih neksus y\u00eblyemardarummem, vesna k\u00e3v y\u00cd\u00d7 venel k\u00c7fag\u00eba\u2019en venka y\u00eblyemarkojun \u00e3\u00d1 enifelenun s\u00c7fowya al."}]},{"blockId":"block.bcd88e3e2a0c4dbf9fb897f4caf4382c","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1055","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblyemard\u00c7\u00d3s\u00dflum: y\u00eblyemar d\u00c7\u00d3 s\u00dflum."}]},{"blockId":"block.f01701221fbc4ad59d331bcd77d285a8","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1093","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Kin \u00d1e\u00d5 varsh \u00e3lumowya y\u00eblyemard\u00c7\u00d3s\u00dflum tav p\u00e1f\u00d7 p\u00e1ns\u00ebrun p\u00e1ns\u00ebrizya."}]},{"blockId":"block.384b912699bd4b1abf099128f8e19244","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1163","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblyemard\u00c7\u00d3s\u00dflum threnina\u00d9inst\u00dfb\u00df marven: y\u00eblyemard\u00c7\u00d3s\u00dflum threnina\u00d9inst\u00dfb\u00df marven."}]},{"blockId":"block.63a6b5efc2c5438d97c1f86ae028928f","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1247","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Kin tha \u00c3\u00cdthavizya ly p\u00e1n yel marven Edward Devis, y\u00eblyemard\u00c7\u00d3s\u00dflum i y\u00eblyemard\u00c7\u00d3s\u00dflum threnina\u00d9inst\u00dfb\u00df marven, ol y\u00eblyemard\u00c7\u00d3s\u00dflum i \u00c3ahikamo\u00d1 \u00cbers hefak gurs\u00dflum\u00e1pe\u00dbem haren a\u00d9imizya; akrad \u00cbers zi\u2019\u00e7l\u00d7on r\u00d7izya."}]},{"blockId":"block.1988210d93db40c285d66599b11b19b1","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1461","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblyemardlen\u00dbemin: y\u00eblyemar dlen\u00dbemin."}]},{"blockId":"block.5478e1535f2046c0b48adadcf18246db","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1500","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Lukonia goryemsjo\u00d9 ni Manila \u00e5\u00c3 \u00c3\u00cdthavowya zi, v\u00ebsil goryemsjo\u00d9 \u00e3\u00d1 Mindora goryemsjo\u00d9 ni y\u00eblyemardlen\u00dbemin\u2019es."}]},{"blockId":"block.c7953e57540c4bcdb71d8908e2960805","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1611","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblyemardlen\u00e7l\u00d7on: y\u00eblyemar dlen \u00e7l\u00d7on."}]},{"blockId":"block.45831fc7daf14ba6812024cb078d784d","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1651","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Ni goryems\u2019y\u00eblyemardlen\u00e7l\u00d7on Zebulunl\u00c9y z\u00e1linatya \u00e3\u00d1 t\u00d7 "}]}]}]},"styleFeatures":{"style.body":{"kern":true,"liga":true}},"characters":[{"start":0,"end":14,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":15,"end":40,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":41,"end":73,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":74,"end":209,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":210,"end":244,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":245,"end":387,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":388,"end":426,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":427,"end":576,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":577,"end":596,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":597,"end":638,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":639,"end":645,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":646,"end":744,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":745,"end":782,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":783,"end":1054,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":1055,"end":1092,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":1093,"end":1162,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":1163,"end":1246,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"ba