nId":"run.qt.132","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Dur\u00ebn y\u00eblyemardur\u00ebn ni \u00e7l\u00d7on r\u00d7owya, grem 22 lomih 24 palesun venor. Dur\u00ebn i y\u00eblyemardur\u00ebn olen \u00e3\u00d1 Siv\u00ebl p\u00c7n\u00df\u00eb velkan \u00e5\u00c3 lunor\u2019es. Naorthrenin nerinmem shalin r\u00c7n\u00d3 gim venla vorkin, grem neksus pales gimkin."}]},{"blockId":"block.03b879b4467e4d04bfc8ffeae710f721","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.340","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblyemargren: gren."}]},{"blockId":"block.2e50bb52d68149b98ad5bbb76487abaf","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.360","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Yelnemh\u00ebth ly\u2019y\u00eblyemarun ly\u2019merthrent\u00e7lh\u00eb\u00d5 tha \u00d3\u00c5tusthrenin palj\u00c5r ni y\u00eblyemargl\u00c9z\u00cbenizya, rav y\u00eblyemargren \u00c3\u00cdizya ly."}]},{"blockId":"block.7ccdffec7fee471c890abaf84da92d3f","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.479","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblyemargl\u00c9z\u00cben: 1 y\u00eblyemar gl\u00c9z\u00cben."}]},{"blockId":"block.6116997c0c194911aa226cfac809fb92","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.516","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Prodnar r\u00e1\u2019masif\u2019m\u00e7 tonun s\u00c7fowya, vinel r\u00e1\u2019w\u00c5vumo\u00c3 r\u00e1\u2019tomil ma\u2019j\u00cd\u2019es gren Izabel y\u00eblyemargl\u00c9z\u00cbenowya."}]},{"blockId":"block.fe8079ae7be844b88d90992529be3976","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.619","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"2 y\u00eblyemar gl\u00c9z\u00cben kranzar."}]},{"blockId":"block.2a6cea92319b4e11b41d0c603f8df82e","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.647","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Goryemsjo\u00d9 \u00d3\u00ebr b\u00e7orvel vorel ni merlunor ni y\u00eblyemargl\u00c9z\u00cbenizya ly, k\u00e3m tondaizfu. Yib\u2019\u00ebw neksus \u00c4\u00d9gif \u00e3\u00d1 thavvimna Yel i threnin kinos dlenizya."}]},{"blockId":"block.fd2c1f86500f471d83404006cc9a59ad","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.793","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"3 y\u00eblyemar gl\u00c9z\u00cben."}]},{"blockId":"block.6a8ad7387268487f8b32cffbd0854f07","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.813","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Yelnemh\u00ebth ly\u2019y\u00eblyemarun ly\u2019merthrent\u00e7lh\u00eb\u00d5 tha \u00d3\u00c5tusthrenin palj\u00c5r ni y\u00eblyemargl\u00c9z\u00cbenizya, rav y\u00eblyemargren \u00c3\u00cdizya ly."}]},{"blockId":"block.f48ade0114b145349501249a3aa9a0f8","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.932","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"4 \u00d1et i y\u00eblyemargl\u00c9z\u00cben."}]},{"blockId":"block.adf5447d3bff4d67899cebc643f01a9d","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.957","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Ni meranjem\u00e3 y\u00eblyemargl\u00c9z\u00cben dlenizya."}]},{"blockId":"block.b86965b2126f4ef88daee53fc68d633b","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.996","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"5 y\u00eblyemar gl\u00c9z\u00cben kranzar."}]},{"blockId":"block.0f188f3fab6544fc85507755ef8b89fc","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1024","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"K\u00e3m goryemsd\u00c7\u00d3s\u00dflumun thar i y\u00eblyemar maser\u00c3\u00cdl\u00e3t\u00d5\u2019en grem r\u00d7izya vin viminy\u00eblyemar nira goryems vel \u00d1on\u00d1izfu grel ef\u2019fengolh\u00dfm k\u00e3m venka tha panen threnin i y\u00eblyemar y\u00eblyemargl\u00c9z\u00cbenun tarn\u2019en \u00c9lmizya."}]},{"blockId":"block.b12d51ce4f83497c867017526d3bf2f4","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1225","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblyemargl\u00c9z\u00cben \u00e7l\u00d7on: y\u00eblyemargl\u00c9z\u00cben \u00e7l\u00d7on."}]},{"blockId":"block.571001837b7d48988dace335e6245351","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1271","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Z\u00e1lagur tharin goryemsthren tha palj\u00c5r, 14 lomih 16 lar mem mel jo\u00d9yem ni far y\u00eblyemargl\u00c9z\u00cben \u00e7l\u00d7on r\u00d7owya."}]},{"blockId":"block.52d6dd52ba3449d9aa936b89303cf371","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1379","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblyemargur: y\u00eblyemar gur."}]},{"blockId":"block.a99a8b30355642b890baedbec24a020c","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1406","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Tha \u00d1em s\u00dflumun ze\u00db\u00e7\u2019en ven\u00e1lw\u00c5vumenizya ly, p\u00c7n\u00df\u00eb mem yib\u2019\u00ebw t\u00d7 zemir s\u00c7fizya zem. Venory\u00cd\u00d7 t\u00d7 nederlands\u00dflumna y\u00eblyemargur wa\u00d9gumizya ly; ni h\u00eb\u00d5\u2019na t\u00e7lizya po, p\u00c7n\u00df\u00eb s\u00dflumun tha zemget ma\u2019ze\u00db\u00e7\u2019lahizya ly."}]},{"blockId":"block.82aa01fb10aa428c8d3590cebca5859f","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1613","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblyemarp\u00e1ns\u00ebn: y\u00eblyemar p\u00e1ns\u00ebn."}]},{"blockId":"block.229d7a29b23b45e3a03ac89ee07c2ddb","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1646","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"P\u00e1n enifelen\u2019en y\u00eblyemarget zem y\u00eblyemarp\u00e1ns\u00ebnizya."}]}]}]},"styleFeatures":{"style.body":{"kern":true,"liga":true}},"characters":[{"start":0,"end":17,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":18,"end":100,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":101,"end":131,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":132,"end":339,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":340,"end":359,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":360,"end":478,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":479,"end":515,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":516,"end":618,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":619,"end":646,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":647,"end":792,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":793,"end":812,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":813,"end":931,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":932,"end":956,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":957,"end":995,"at