ype":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.163","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Ni ner\u00e7ztizfu komves, y\u00eblyemarvorelyat\u2019en lomih marin murdat dlen\u2019en gim marin murdat y\u00eblyemarjem\u00e3 r\u00d7owya."}]},{"blockId":"block.51a1a52b61f4469281b267565feb0de8","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.270","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblyemarz\u00dfgu\u00d9: y\u00eblyemar z\u00dfgu\u00d9."}]},{"blockId":"block.3ad69c1459214acbadf37077b6e14a72","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.301","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Taren Destre kin kom zi\u2019y\u00eblyemarz\u00dfgu\u00d9 b\u00e9rvizya. B\u00e7orvel tha t\u00e7l\u2019es enifelenelyi\u00d1 i tar slebizya zi; dlen i zi\u2019y\u00eblyemarz\u00dfgu\u00d9 p\u00e1nmartonda f\u00c5w\u2019en zarunkerthun j\u00cdenarizya."}]},{"blockId":"block.5fdd1a672d2745238473cbfdbd778a94","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.469","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblyemarz\u00dfgu\u00d9nor\u00d3as\u00dflum: y\u00eblyemarz\u00dfgu\u00d9 nor\u00d3as\u00dflum."}]},{"blockId":"block.014f3f20f6584cfc927f03c819169f53","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.520","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"\u00d0em hefak gurs\u00dflumun naora\u00d9imatya, \u00e3\u00d1 nel arvenek Burbon ly\u2019naor\u2019m\u00e7 y\u00eblyemarz\u00dfgu\u00d9nor\u00d3as\u00dflum r\u00c7n\u00d3 ly\u2019var\u00dfnna\u2019m\u00e7 y\u00eblyemarz\u00dfgu\u00d9 \u00cbers y\u00eblyemar \u00db\u00c7datya zemget na."}]},{"blockId":"block.6e2b0f23bd234075973b8afba110bd0e","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.678","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblyemarelyi\u00d1: 1 y\u00eblyemar elyi\u00d1."}]},{"blockId":"block.50060addcc76403d815dabdc02bc4ddd","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.711","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Kom neksus \u00cbers neksus zemget ol ni h\u00eb\u00d5 l\u00ddn\u00c5r verzetmatondun \u00e7zttharatya lym \u00e3\u00d1 nelir y\u00eblyemarelyi\u00d1 r\u00c7n\u00d3 far\u2019m\u00e7 Vengraf y\u00eblyemarelyi\u00d1atya nel."}]},{"blockId":"block.99d90b589d1942c3ba7ad93a7f0d6357","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.854","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"2 meranelyi\u00d1."}]},{"blockId":"block.1f8c4f8b82824471a359805ff2fd4b5b","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.868","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Al y\u00eblyemarun o\u00c3e \u00d1etib venka kom goren r\u00d7owya \u00e3\u00d1 \u00cbers krasel enifun terastimowya venim \u00cbers gim vimin y\u00eblyemarelyi\u00d1 o\u00c3t\u00e7 elyi\u00d1arimowya k\u00c7nibgrafel y\u00eblyemarmiktaz\u00d7rs\u00dflum \u00c9lmowya."}]},{"blockId":"block.60d3d71ae87246eaa60fb76a16836965","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1047","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"3 y\u00eblyemar elyi\u00d1."}]},{"blockId":"block.611c93c76ff44b5987c065029d425565","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1065","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"R\u00dfv \u00cbers b\u00e7orvel enif ni r\u00d7izya, kin \u00e1pe\u00dbem kwistenif; \u00d3\u00ebr m\u00ebren \u00cbers \u00d3\u00ebr y\u00eblyemarelyi\u00d1izya ly, Galapagos i goryemsjo\u00d9un i \u00d3\u00ebrr\u00dfvarventhrenmem nira enifelen\u2019en rav m\u00ebren thav y\u00eblyemarelyi\u00d1\u2019en vennerb\u2019es. Lamem thavren ma\u2019h\u00c5b\u00cdizya ly, thav jemin marjo\u00d9 \u00e5\u00c3 zemget ma\u2019\u00d1\u00c7lnok\u2019jw\u00ebnizya."}]},{"blockId":"block.e30f4e655f4b44b5bee018b2d6f68a59","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1347","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblyemarfader: Y\u00eblyemarviminy\u00eblyemar \u00d1etib h\u00ebth a\u00d9s\u00dflum \u00c3\u00cdthavowya \u00cbers tremb\u00c5run i k\u00cfba\u00d1s\u00dflumun venim d\u00c7\u00d3owya."}]},{"blockId":"block.121b634c8b72480b95a09ec9854b14c5","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1459","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"A\u00d9s\u00dflum venor\u2019m\u00e7 venor thav r\u00d7izya. Lym venik\u2019t threnin \u00e3lumizya \u00e3\u00d1 y\u00eblyemarfader tav \u00e5vizya."}]},{"blockId":"block.0fc5b492e170416fac839ca2f5560828","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1553","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblyemarmarjo\u00d9: y\u00eblyemar marjo\u00d9."}]},{"blockId":"block.b76ddc1bdfaa4bd4bca5dd1a7d6b2e9f","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1586","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"\u00d2\u00c5tusol \u00e7l\u00d7onun ni jw\u00ebnenplestenlen r\u00c7n\u00d3 jo\u00d9izya ly \u00e3\u00d1 elen ni kwesthrenna merlunor gren thal i y\u00eblyemarmarjo\u00d9get akradizya. P\u00c7n\u00df\u00eb y\u00ebl nira ybs\u00dfizya zem k\u00c7nib y\u00eblyemarmarjo\u00d9get b\u00e9rvizya ly."}]}]}]},"styleFeatures":{"style.bo