nguageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblyemarmarven: 1 y\u00eblyemar marven."}]},{"blockId":"block.d9cbf40545f4471c9f0a924cdbb7b2b4","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.410","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"T\u00d7 ni neksus ventin kom goren minem \u00e5\u00c3 mav\u00d1et t\u00e7lowfu \u00e3\u00d1 elenol y\u00eblyemarmarven \u00e3\u00d1 ol ni y\u00eblyemarun r\u00c7n\u00d3vem \u00e3\u00d1 goryemsd\u00c7\u00d3s\u00dflumun \u00e3\u00d1 k\u00e3m gim\u00dfv k\u00e3m \u00cbers goryems kwistowya thavim thav kojizya."}]},{"blockId":"block.602b4d5a00e244ca9878a3917d2fad08","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.599","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"2 y\u00eblyemar marven."}]},{"blockId":"block.b7ddc5a8549747b0a70a1c9aadff5a44","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.618","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Y\u00eblyemarmarven\u2019h\u00c5 \u00d1e\u00d5 kl\u00e1rjems\u00dflum maser\u00ebw f\u00c5wowya r\u00e1 nelel."}]},{"blockId":"block.44f9792983664425be105b22308e94c8","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.679","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblyemarmemvor: y\u00eblyemar memvor."}]},{"blockId":"block.e861e388695e48049b7cb78fd4d6df0a","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.712","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"\u00c0\u2019t Yel vimin b\u00cfeb\u00d3\u00c5\u00e7 tha Gwayakil \u00e7ztizya ly; yib\u2019\u00ebw y\u00eblyemarmemvor s\u00c7fizya."}]},{"blockId":"block.fca104e401d1401fa480949256b86dba","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.790","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblyemarm\u00d7ss\u00dflum: y\u00eblyemar m\u00d7ss\u00dflum."}]},{"blockId":"block.a4c2277570b1442894f7c7e6fc63e6ab","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.827","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Marven Jon Kanbi tha \u00d1e\u00d5 taren s\u00c7fizya r\u00e1, rav y\u00eblyemar i y\u00eblyemar d\u00cdn\u00d7r jem\u00e3s\u00dflum \u00e3\u00d1 z\u00e1linhif\u00e5r r\u00d7izya falib; Abraham Wais haren y\u00eblyemarm\u00d7ss\u00dflum \u00e3\u00d1 Leonard Jeferis \u00d3\u00c5tus\u2019t y\u00eblyemarm\u00d7ss\u00dflum r\u00d7izya."}]},{"blockId":"block.7f2d4c700be24a41805c21ac59d9b054","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1026","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblyemarmiktaz\u00d7rs\u00dflum: 1 y\u00eblyemar miktaz\u00d7rs\u00dflum."}]},{"blockId":"block.3ad57a3fd16d4516b34e3a12db6070fd","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1075","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Neksus s\u00dflum ly\u2019y\u00eblyemarmiktaz\u00d7rs\u00dflum k\u00e3m t\u00e7l\u2019en miktaz\u00d7rh\u00eb\u2019en kelde\u00dbonjw\u00ebnenizya p\u00c7n\u00df\u00eb matondizya zi."}]},{"blockId":"block.54ff8bac2f944183b6f1a09a1bd2158c","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1178","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"2 goryemmar."}]},{"blockId":"block.293628cdb4d7406bb9ab0e9c13767514","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1191","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Ol\u2019\u00e3 falib yems\u00d7 nerda\u00c3get gl\u00c9z\u00cbenowya goryemsd\u00c7\u00d3s\u00dflumun \u00e3\u00d1 ol y\u00eblyemarmiktaz\u00d7rs\u00dflumun i goryems tha zem\u2019y\u00eblyemarun vel t\u00e7latya zem gren jo\u00d9 kojatya."}]},{"blockId":"block.e4894f6fc1e34db2b2d5abf40aa7b579","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1341","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblyemars\u00dfrnmem: y\u00eblyemar S\u00dfrn mem."}]},{"blockId":"block.056a4bddc1764f3f830552e3510ccd42","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1377","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Gwam \u00e5\u00c3 \u00d1e\u00d5 marjo\u00d9 i venor taren lam\u00ebw y\u00cd\u00d7 ragumen\u2019jor ly k\u00e3v s\u00dfrn\u2019jor, b\u00e7orvel enif \u00e3\u00d1 ven kom jw\u00ebnenplesten r\u00d7izfu \u00e3\u00d1 venarna k\u00e3m ly\u2019y\u00eblyemars\u00dfrnmemget ly h\u00ebth a\u00d9\u00d5\u00dfrizfu."}]},{"blockId":"block.ecfe2d048fa94fa0bb0345d2117b2edb","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1550","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblyemars\u00ebven: Y\u00eblyemar ni \u00d1etib s\u00ebven ven\u2019m\u00e7 r\u00d7izya \u00e3\u00d1 po\u2019venor lomih \u00e7l\u00d7on den\u2019jw\u00ebnowya."}]},{"blockId":"block.1595600b10d44220a9eb4d66ec660e7c","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1641","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Neks threnin tha vesna s\u00dflum j\u00cdizya. Tha daral venra r\u00e1 y\u00eblyemars\u00ebven f\u00c5w\u2019jw\u00ebnizya."}]}]}]},"styleFeatures":{"style.body":{"kern":true,"liga":true}},"characters":[{"start":0,"end":20,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":21,"end":34,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpaci