0ab317","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.14","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblymmemfader"}]},{"blockId":"block.322f569255d04188be4652aeb71bef0f","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.28","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Enif lym thav \u00db\u00c7dizya. Vin meranelyi\u00d1 broftizya y\u00eblylyatmajo\u00d9 p\u00e1izya."}]},{"blockId":"block.6871882bced145ba828770dd1a0cad77","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.98","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblylyatmelum: Y\u00eblyemarvorelyat f\u00d7\u2019en vinel \u00cbers denun gren marjo\u00d9 marjo\u00d9 tav \u00e3\u00d1 tav \u00e3lum\u2019en."}]},{"blockId":"block.2594dddfbfe0463eb30e8e4573350d48","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.192","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Ni neks threnin jemin\u2019m\u00e7 \u00d3\u00e1lun\u00c3izya. \u00caers kwesta rav \u00cbers y\u00eblverzet lym y\u00eblylyatmelumizya."}]},{"blockId":"block.8d33a4b93ca5442b8b6bd483ea67454e","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.283","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblylyi\u00d1vejem: Den gren y\u00eblyemarelyi\u00d1 \u00d1etib tremb\u00c5r thrin venor\u2019m\u00e7 \u00e5v a\u00d9owya."}]},{"blockId":"block.17844eedeea84eabb24b847fa0d61c59","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.361","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"\u00d2\u00c5tus y\u00eblyemarelyi\u00d1 ilna\u2019m\u00e7 \u00d3\u00e1lun\u00c3izya. Ni y\u00eblylyi\u00d1vejem r\u00e1\u2019mela h\u00c5b\u00cdizya \u00d1etib za\u2019k\u00cfba\u00d1 r\u00d7izya."}]},{"blockId":"block.7605f1a7ead948ec89efbe2164d3ac3d","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.458","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblylyi\u00d1vesna: \u00d0et \u00d1etib ni \u00e7l\u00d7on i y\u00eblyemarelyi\u00d1 po\u2019d\u00c7\u00d3 f\u00d7owya."}]},{"blockId":"block.d3e3efb8e80c46e0b01b1e776e17e77e","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.523","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Y\u00eblyemarelyi\u00d1 b\u00e9rvimizya. Vinto po t\u00d7y\u00dfb\u00dfimizya y\u00eblylyi\u00d1vesna ly\u2019d\u00c7\u00d3 \u00db\u00c7dizya."}]},{"blockId":"block.1c6be9fb4ede4774b24382786c91c97a","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.601","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblylyi\u00d1fader: Y\u00eblyemarelyi\u00d1 \u00d1etib h\u00ebth a\u00d9s\u00dflum \u00c3\u00cdthavowya \u00cbers tremb\u00c5run i k\u00cfba\u00d1s\u00dflumun venim d\u00c7\u00d3owya."}]},{"blockId":"block.bc529dba090145ee96a7c2ade435235e","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.705","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"A\u00d9s\u00dflum venor\u2019m\u00e7 venor thav r\u00d7izya. Lym venik\u2019t threnin \u00e3lumizya \u00e3\u00d1 y\u00eblylyi\u00d1fader tav \u00e5vizya."}]},{"blockId":"block.3f5fe005c2414a3b84597ed509931f7e","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.799","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblymvorvejem: Den gren y\u00eblyemarmemvor \u00d1etib tremb\u00c5r thrin venor\u2019m\u00e7 \u00e5v a\u00d9owya."}]},{"blockId":"block.1371e49ff34446fbb53b319cd2a8d131","type":"paragraph