language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblynzarake\u00dbon: Y\u00eblyemar gl\u00c9z\u00cben kranzar \u00d1etib t\u00d7 venor jem\u00e3imowya vinto h\u00c5b\u00cd\u2019m\u00e7 w\u00cf\u00dfen broftimowya."}]},{"blockId":"block.98a877a9bcf541bc916e28dae5057829","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.444","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Za y\u00eblynzarake\u00dbon f\u00c5wizya \u00e3\u00d1 rav \u00d1etib l\u00e1mgl\u00c9st po \u00e3lumatya s\u00eb\u00dbgaizya."}]},{"blockId":"block.c96fe4e1717a419a88f30b7cee7535e9","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.515","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblynzarden: Neks w\u00c5vumen i y\u00eblyemar gl\u00c9z\u00cben kranzar \u00d1etib w\u00cf\u00dfen miktaz\u00d7rs\u00dflumowya p\u00e1n l\u00e1mgl\u00c9st t\u00e7lowya."}]},{"blockId":"block.d235b2bc56484769a286ffd7291c7744","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.620","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"R\u00e1 broft venim ma\u2019s\u00c7fizya. \u00caers y\u00eblynzarden r\u00e1 \u00d1etib w\u00cf\u00dfen ef\u2019w\u00cf\u00df h\u00c5b\u00cdizya."}]},{"blockId":"block.a8d35c1be08f461f8fdf03a5987e8578","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.696","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblynegavejem: Den gren y\u00eblyemaryems\u00d7onega \u00d1etib tremb\u00c5r thrin venor\u2019m\u00e7 \u00e5v a\u00d9owya."}]},{"blockId":"block.a74be31dbfa9411a8c64a172e5aa01b2","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.779","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"\u00d2\u00c5tus y\