38912d0833e34c33f","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.782","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Y\u00eblyemarika\u00d9 b\u00e9rvimizya. Vinto po t\u00d7y\u00dfb\u00dfimizya y\u00eblyika\u00d9vesna ly\u2019d\u00c7\u00d3 \u00db\u00c7dizya."}]},{"blockId":"block.3300c43efa854cb5bbd047342a052b74","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.859","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblyika\u00d9fader: Y\u00eblyemarika\u00d9 \u00d1etib h\u00ebth a\u00d9s\u00dflum \u00c3\u00cdthavowya \u00cbers tremb\u00c5run i k\u00cfba\u00d1s\u00dflumun venim d\u00c7\u00d3owya."}]},{"blockId":"block.f2716d9086224499b9206eee5533370f","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.962","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"A\u00d9s\u00dflum venor\u2019m\u00e7 venor thav r\u00d7izya. Lym venik\u2019t threnin \u00e3lumizya \u00e3\u00d1 y\u00eblyika\u00d9fader tav \u00e5vizya."}]},{"blockId":"block.49e77ee52a71492faaf34ce0c7fcc0aa","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1056","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblyiren\u00cb\u00cdnon: Y\u00eblyemarthiren \u00d1etib \u00cbers venor\u2019m\u00e7 \u00cb\u00cdnon marin p\u00e1f\u00d7\u2019m\u00e7 w\u00c5vumen f\u00d7imowya."}]},{"blockId":"block.a041e0d7ba604b5395262cb60d36718d","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1144","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Vinel pel giktenv\u00d7izya za\u2019tremb\u00c5r y\u00eblyiren\u00cb\u00cdnon grasnotizya. Yib\u2019\u00ebw rav za vel veritasizya."}]},{"blockId":"block.412d3c2f1a384df2b2be80792b9d28d2","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1236","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblyirenveerb: Y\u00eblyemarthiren \u00d1etib s\u00dflum \u00cbers nerbyal f\u00d7owya \u00e3\u00d1 t\u00d7 \u00d1etib broft\u2019jw\u00ebnowya."}]},{"blockId":"block.58c052508dff4f9a86cfceb854637075","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1326","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Vesna tremb\u00c5r ilna\u2019m\u00e7 falnthren \u00cbers vengraf f\u00d7izya. R\u00e1\u2019y\u00eblyirenveerb r\u00e1 p\u00e1n s\u00ebvenun nerbyalizya."}]},{"blockId":"block.248f09eccfe643119c7fc86aa44a4381","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1424","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblyirenin\u00dfb\u00df: Y\u00eblyemarthiren k\u00e3m vesna s\u00dflum nerbyalizya f\u00d7\u2019en p\u00c7n\u00df\u00eb t\u00d7 k\u00cfba\u00d1\u2019m\u00e7 f\u00c7l broft\u2019en."}]},{"blockId":"block.082433bfc2074596b3487e9dd27a44b3","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1520","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Nerbyal za\u2019k\u00cfba\u00d1 r\u00d7izya. R\u00c7n\u00d3 r\u00e1\u2019tremb\u00c5r r\u00e1 y\u00eblyirenin\u00dfb\u00dfizya \u00e3\u00d1 t\u00d7 murlametw\u00c5vum r\u00e1 broftizya."}]}]}]},"styleFeatures":{"style.body":{"kern":true,"liga":true}},"characters":[{"start":0,"end":13,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":14,"end":46,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":47,"end":158,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":159,"end":238,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":239,"end":331,"attributes":{"tracking":0,"wordSpacing":0.0,"baseline":0.0}},{"start":332,