irection":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.15","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00ebly\u00dfluminoven"}]},{"blockId":"block.b0a5e02f98154196ada1a118bc4feecf","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.30","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Gren nor\u00d3aint\u00dff\u00c9ben vesna den kojizya. Vin d\u00c7\u00d3 t\u00e7lizya ol \u00e5\u00c3 y\u00ebly\u00dfluma\u00cb\u00cdnon elyi\u00d1izya."}]},{"blockId":"block.a88fc8c6e7164b188dd9c359a791b4cd","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.117","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00ebly\u00dflumalarod: Y\u00eblyemarr\u00ddy\u00d3s\u00dflum \u00e5\u00c3 falib s\u00dflumun jw\u00ebnenplesten\u2019m\u00e7 d\u00c7\u00d3 \u00cbers lamprod y\u00c9nenowya."}]},{"blockId":"block.3dc2b0d3219247bb9bc136380277b37d","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.213","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Neks den gren nor\u00d3aint\u00dff\u00c9ben vesna\u2019m\u00e7 r\u00d7izya. T\u00d7 jw\u00ebnenplesten\u2019m\u00e7 voren zem ni dar\u00c5el i y\u00ebly\u00dflumalarod wa\u00d9gumizya."}]},{"blockId":"block.adb897d8f05e4ba6917082f387339c8e","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.328","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00ebly\u00dflumanoven: S\u00dflum falib d\u00c7\u00d3 i y\u00eblyemarr\u00ddy\u00d3s\u00dflum t\u00d7 vimin\u2019m\u00e7 venor ni po\u2019\u00e7l\u00d7on f\u00d7owya."}]},{"blockId":"block.bfb26f2bf2f94278a941e405c2d6c823","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.418","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Y\u00eblyemarr\u00ddy\u00d3s\u00dflum sezif\u00c7\u00c3izya. Y\u00ebly\u00dflumanoven taren f\u00c5wizya \u00e3\u00d1 braden sezif\u00c7\u00c3izya."}]},{"blockId":"block.d1dfcd2a301b420da2136fe1ba340ba8","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.501","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00ebly\u00dflum\u00cb\u00cdnon: S\u00dflum falib d\u00c7\u00d3 i y\u00eblyemar d\u00cdn\u00d7r jem\u00e3s\u00dflum vingim f\u00d7owya p\u00e1n arventhrenden mlapv\u00d7staowya."}]},{"blockId":"block.32cdab8b240e4f8596ddff199edc1d63","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.606","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Gren nor\u00d3aint\u00dff\u00c9ben vesna den kojizya. Vin d\u00c7\u00d3 t\u00e7lizya ol \u00e5\u00c3 y\u00ebly\u00dflum\u00cb\u00cdnon elyi\u00d1izya."}]},{"blockId":"block.03f77885f32d419990083cdf98b7adbe","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.692","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00ebly\u00dflumlarod: Y\u00eblyemar d\u00cdn\u00d7r jem\u00e3s\u00dflum \u00e5\u00c3 falib s\u00dflumun jw\u00ebnenplesten\u2019m\u00e7 d\u00c7\u00d3 \u00cbers lamprod y\u00c9nenowya."}]},{"blockId":"block.416662dcf94d4d5fa68bb426f789ac51","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.794","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Neks den gren nor\u00d3aint\u00dff\u00c9ben vesna\u2019m\u00e7 r\u00d7izya. T\u00d7 jw\u00ebnenplesten\u2019m\u00e7 voren zem ni dar\u00c5el i y\u00ebly\u00dflumlarod wa\u00d9gumizya."}]},{"blockId":"block.313a5d0aedf3465e951f66da09864c25","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.908","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\