en nor\u00d3aint\u00dff\u00c9ben vesna den kojizya. Vin d\u00c7\u00d3 t\u00e7lizya ol \u00e5\u00c3 y\u00ebly\u00dflumu\u00cb\u00cdnon elyi\u00d1izya."}]},{"blockId":"block.1477e75dc3b4483d9c030e0e3d82816e","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.300","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00ebly\u00dflumularod: Y\u00eblyemarz\u00dfgu\u00d9nor\u00d3as\u00dflum \u00e5\u00c3 falib s\u00dflumun jw\u00ebnenplesten\u2019m\u00e7 d\u00c7\u00d3 \u00cbers lamprod y\u00c9nenowya."}]},{"blockId":"block.bee563ad739d4eb5b81f61b646377c65","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.402","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Neks den gren nor\u00d3aint\u00dff\u00c9ben vesna\u2019m\u00e7 r\u00d7izya. T\u00d7 jw\u00ebnenplesten\u2019m\u00e7 voren zem ni dar\u00c5el i y\u00ebly\u00dflumularod wa\u00d9gumizya."}]},{"blockId":"block.ece40d83257c4e4982e77e191bbb3500","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.517","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00ebly\u00dflumunoven: S\u00dflum falib d\u00c7\u00d3 i y\u00eblyemarz\u00dfgu\u00d9nor\u00d3as\u00dflum t\u00d7 vimin\u2019m\u00e7 venor ni po\u2019\u00e7l\u00d7on f\u00d7owya."}]},{"blockId":"block.f3f50ac11afc41aeb70a00802ff01fd0","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.613","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Y\u00eblyemarz\u00dfgu\u00d9nor\u00d3as\u00dflum sezif\u00c7\u00c3izya. Y\u00ebly\u00dflumunoven taren f\u00c5wizya \u00e3\u00d1 braden sezif\u00c7\u00c3izya."}]},{"blockId":"block.5719adef54b445d0b50681d16fcb3a43","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.702","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblyur\u00ebnvejem: Den gren y\u00eblyemardur\u00ebn \u00d1etib tremb\u00c5r thrin venor\u2019m\u00e7 \u00e5v a\u00d9owya."}]},{"blockId":"block.b6174f6a974741338b65ef509b864b57","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.780","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"\u00d2\u00c5tus y\u00eblyemardur\u00ebn ilna\u2019m\u00e7 \u00d3\u00e1lun\u00c3izya. Ni y\u00eblyur\u00ebnvejem r\u00e1\u2019mela h\u00c5b\u00cdizya \u00d1etib za\u2019k\u00cfba\u00d1 r\u00d7izya."}]},{"blockId":"block.fb3a350ddb854d90af59cf24e84d1843","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.877","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblyur\u00ebnvesna: \u00d0et \u00d1etib ni \u00e7l\u00d7on i y\u00eblyemardur\u00ebn po\u2019d\u00c7\u00d3 f\u00d7owya."}]},{"blockId":"block.c77252b7755242029655c479a137e1f3","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.942","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Y\u00eblyemardur\u00ebn b\u00e9rvimizya. Vinto po t\u00d7y\u00dfb\u00dfimizya y\u00eblyur\u00ebnvesna ly\u2019d\u00c7\u00d3 \u00db\u00c7dizya."}]},{"blockId":"block.4efca4b7115d4ca8913dc074c53cab09","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1020","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00eblyur\u00ebnfader: Y\u00eblyemardur\u00ebn \u00d1etib h\u00ebth a\u00d9s\u00dflum \u00c3\u00cdthavowya \u00cbers tremb\u00c5run i k\u00cfba\u00d1s\u00dflumun venim d\u00c7\u00d3owya."}]},{"blockId":"block.423fa2b70af341bdb903299074c18c2b","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1124","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"A\u00d9s\u00dflum venor\u2019m\u00e7 venor thav r\u00d7izya. Lym venik\u2019t threnin \u00e3lumizya \u00e3\u00d1 y\u00eblyur\u00ebnfader tav \u00e5vizya."}]},{"blockId":"block.bce47f1c26234a7f8f9839ccdd18643b","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1218","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00ebsil: vorenet \u00cbers \u00d1etib pel ner\u00c3\u00cdowya lomih m\u00ebr yems\u00d7pulenowya."}]},{"blockId":"block.0497820bc56f4556b826c76864c211f1","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1284","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Ven y\u00eblyemar r\u00c7n\u00d3 po\u2019goren\u2019m\u00e7 y\u00eblyemarkoj \u00c5\u00d9b\u00d7r thrinterastnerda\u00c3owya \u00e3\u00d1 s\u00dfrnven \u00cbers y\u00ebsil \u00e3\u00d1 yems\u00d7pulen niwemizfu r\u00d7owya k\u00e3m y\u00eblbra nira por\u00ebnharen nerda\u00c3\u2019es ne."}]},{"blockId":"block.a5424ba81aa34876ae8fc92bcb1baa02","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1448","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00ebsilj\u00c9net: Vimin\u2019m\u00e7 threnin i y\u00ebsil \u00d1etib ma\u2019\u00e7zt\u2019jw\u00ebnowya p\u00c7n\u00df\u00eb j\u00c9gwa\u00c3vorenet \u00e3lumowya."}]},{"blockId":"block.f2f8c3afd6414eefb0ebd02d019f5a26","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1537","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"Tha j\u00c9gwa\u00c3vorenet y\u00ebsil ma\u2019z\u00dfgu\u00d9\u2019jw\u00ebnizya. \u00caers \u00e3lum lym y\u00ebsilj\u00c9net portimostizya."}]},{"blockId":"block.7d329a65cd1941298d3dab91bdde7a35","type":"paragraph","direction":"ltr","runs":[{"runId":"run.qt.1620","languageId":"language.vayrshemon","styleId":"style.body","type":"unicode","normalization":"none","text":"y\u00ebsiltae\u00db\u00e7: Y\u00ebsil tha p\u00e1nna\u2019